(2635440, 365710, 62249, '<td valign="top">Orange/blue combo is pleasing, as is subtle blue pattern in water. Nice composition. A little too much noise and not enough sharpness.</td>', 'Orange/blue combo is pleasing, as is subtle blue pattern in water. Nice composition. A little too much noise and not enough sharpness.', '2006-07-19 02:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2635452, 363474, 20168, '<td valign="top">Awesome title to an equally awesome beach shot with that quiet symbolism of father/son mirrored in the two sea stacks in the foreground (including the shape of their heads!) and the mysterious sea stack in the background as the unseen generation, grandfather who looks on unseen from off the edge of the frame, evoking a sense of greater than time and space...lovely and one of my favorites in this challenge!</td>', 'Awesome title to an equally awesome beach shot with that quiet symbolism of father/son mirrored in the two sea stacks in the foreground (including the shape of their heads!) and the mysterious sea stack in the background as the unseen generation, grandfather who looks on unseen from off the edge of the frame, evoking a sense of greater than time and space...lovely and one of my favorites in this challenge!', '2006-07-19 02:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2635453, 363911, 62249, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus on bird, nicely blurred sky, good feather detail.</td>', 'Sharp focus on bird, nicely blurred sky, good feather detail.', '2006-07-19 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2635454, 365968, 37430, '<td valign="top">This is lovely photo of beautiful location. I really dont see very tight relationship with the theme though. This is picture of the source itself and not of something on or closer to water source. Keeping this point aside - I''d have given it 10 (in isolation).8.</td>', 'This is lovely photo of beautiful location. I really dont see very tight relationship with the theme though. This is picture of the source itself and not of something on or closer to water source. Keeping this point aside - I''d have given it 10 (in isolation).8.', '2006-07-19 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
