(2636669, 366059, 40355, '<td valign="top">Solid shot, nice colors and composition.  The tennis ball and title add some humor and an extra "punch" to the whole thing.  Good job!</td>', 'Solid shot, nice colors and composition.  The tennis ball and title add some humor and an extra "punch" to the whole thing.  Good job!', '2006-07-19 09:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
