(2636696, 364476, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, sort of a minimalist approach.  Overall, I like it.  The sky gets a bit dark at the top, but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, sort of a minimalist approach.  Overall, I like it.  The sky gets a bit dark at the top, but otherwise very nice.', '2006-07-19 09:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
