(2636722, 365610, 2764, '<td valign="top">Here is a lovely photo which will have trouble competing in the photoshop DPC world.  Post it to the forums and let the PS ghurus have a go at it after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Here is a lovely photo which will have trouble competing in the photoshop DPC world.  Post it to the forums and let the PS ghurus have a go at it after the challenge is over.', '2006-07-19 09:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
