(2636726, 363874, 40355, '<td valign="top">Nice use of silhouettes and some good color.  The horizon is a bit too tilted for my taste however.  Interestingly, your lens flares line up with the girl in a way that works with the image and title - don''t know if this was intentional or luck, but well done.</td>', 'Nice use of silhouettes and some good color.  The horizon is a bit too tilted for my taste however.  Interestingly, your lens flares line up with the girl in a way that works with the image and title - don''t know if this was intentional or luck, but well done.', '2006-07-19 09:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
