(2636759, 365427, 61234, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see the barracuda. I just wish the horizon was straight. As is, it tends to be distracting to the forground. Nice beach find.</td>', 'I can definitely see the barracuda. I just wish the horizon was straight. As is, it tends to be distracting to the forground. Nice beach find.', '2006-07-19 09:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2636760, 366148, 5354, '<td valign="top">I want to give this a 10, but the horizon ''feels'' to tilt down on the left. I think this must be an illusion because when I checked it it was just a gnats whisker down. This gives me a dilemma in that I know its level(ish) but the feel tells me otherwise. 10 or 9 ...... I''ll probably change my mind several times on this one over the week.</td>', 'I want to give this a 10, but the horizon ''feels'' to tilt down on the left. I think this must be an illusion because when I checked it it was just a gnats whisker down. This gives me a dilemma in that I know its level(ish) but the feel tells me otherwise. 10 or 9 ...... I''ll probably change my mind several times on this one over the week.', '2006-07-19 09:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
