(2637681, 363893, 57202, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like how the waves crashing against the rocks make the point of the sign very clear. :)  This photo would have "popped" even more for me if it were taken slightly to the right (so that the sign wasn''t obstructing the crashing waves at all) and if there were a bit more color to the sky (Hue/Saturation adjustment, maybe?).  Overall great shot though. :)</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like how the waves crashing against the rocks make the point of the sign very clear. :)  This photo would have "popped" even more for me if it were taken slightly to the right (so that the sign wasn''t obstructing the crashing waves at all) and if there were a bit more color to the sky (Hue/Saturation adjustment, maybe?).  Overall great shot though. :)', '2006-07-19 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637682, 365609, 43529, '<td valign="top">A great capture! I like the contrast between the people.</td>', 'A great capture! I like the contrast between the people.', '2006-07-19 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637684, 365296, 61818, '<td valign="top">Today a man found a massive burning orb on the beach.  Thinking quickly, he donned a fire retardant shoe and kicked the ball of fire out over the ocean.  There he quickly took a photo of the feat and submitted it to DPC.</td>', 'Today a man found a massive burning orb on the beach.  Thinking quickly, he donned a fire retardant shoe and kicked the ball of fire out over the ocean.  There he quickly took a photo of the feat and submitted it to DPC.', '2006-07-19 12:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637685, 364921, 61818, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo taken of a tv screen.</td>', 'Looks like a photo taken of a tv screen.', '2006-07-19 12:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
