(2637693, 364041, 46371, '<td valign="top">free willy, got it. found on ponds,lakes and rivers.I like it.</td>', 'free willy, got it. found on ponds,lakes and rivers.I like it.', '2006-07-19 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637694, 366192, 61818, '<td valign="top">You found a beach on the beach?</td>', 'You found a beach on the beach?', '2006-07-19 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637696, 365674, 57202, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot.  The blue tones in this photo are awesome. :)  I also like how the river leads you back into the shot and towards the mountains.  Though I realize that this obviously must have been shot in the shadow of a mountain or hill, it would have scored even higher with me if it were taken closer to sunset and without the visible threshold between shadow and direct sunlight.  Great photo though! :D</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot.  The blue tones in this photo are awesome. :)  I also like how the river leads you back into the shot and towards the mountains.  Though I realize that this obviously must have been shot in the shadow of a mountain or hill, it would have scored even higher with me if it were taken closer to sunset and without the visible threshold between shadow and direct sunlight.  Great photo though! :D', '2006-07-19 12:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637698, 364830, 61818, '<td valign="top">Crop out less of the ducks, get the fake birds in focus so the contrast is more apparent.  Nice idea. 5.</td>', 'Crop out less of the ducks, get the fake birds in focus so the contrast is more apparent.  Nice idea. 5.', '2006-07-19 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
