(2637761, 365639, 61818, '<td valign="top">Another tsunami shot.  All these poor stooges standing on the beach posing as if they were just found, and then BLAMMO in come the waves.  A challenge filled with tragedy.</td>', 'Another tsunami shot.  All these poor stooges standing on the beach posing as if they were just found, and then BLAMMO in come the waves.  A challenge filled with tragedy.', '2006-07-19 13:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
