(2637789, 366020, 40355, '<td valign="top">Different, but very nice.  The reflections in the water drops are facinating, and I''m a fan of the OOF bg.  Good luck!  10</td>', 'Different, but very nice.  The reflections in the water drops are facinating, and I''m a fan of the OOF bg.  Good luck!  10', '2006-07-19 13:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
