(2637798, 366221, 40355, '<td valign="top">Scenic island, and the tones of the ocean are amazing.  The forground looks to be just a tad overexposed - a CP or ND filter might have really kicked this up another step.  But as is, it''s still very good.  8</td>', 'Scenic island, and the tones of the ocean are amazing.  The forground looks to be just a tad overexposed - a CP or ND filter might have really kicked this up another step.  But as is, it''s still very good.  8', '2006-07-19 13:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2637801, 366208, 40355, '<td valign="top">VERY, very well done.  The shallow depth of focus on just the shell is great, with the waves OOF.  You have perfect lighting and contrast here, and the forboding clouds with sunbeams really pushes the emotive feeling of the whole image.  10</td>', 'VERY, very well done.  The shallow depth of focus on just the shell is great, with the waves OOF.  You have perfect lighting and contrast here, and the forboding clouds with sunbeams really pushes the emotive feeling of the whole image.  10', '2006-07-19 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
