(2639386, 365067, 28471, '<td valign="top">There is too much negative space in this photo for my taste.  The negative is really emphasized by the one person in the frame.  I realize this may have been your intent but I would have zoomed in a bit.</td>', 'There is too much negative space in this photo for my taste.  The negative is really emphasized by the one person in the frame.  I realize this may have been your intent but I would have zoomed in a bit.', '2006-07-19 19:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
