(2639404, 365698, 28471, '<td valign="top">While technically meeting this challenge I feel that is was met rather weakly.    Yes it is body of land that borders the water but I fail to find any realy point of interest in this photo.</td>', 'While technically meeting this challenge I feel that is was met rather weakly.    Yes it is body of land that borders the water but I fail to find any realy point of interest in this photo.', '2006-07-19 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
