(2639410, 365778, 28471, '<td valign="top">Placing the directly dead center in the frame doesn''t do much to enhance the compostion of this photo.  I feel this would have been better served off-center and horizontal.</td>', 'Placing the directly dead center in the frame doesn''t do much to enhance the compostion of this photo.  I feel this would have been better served off-center and horizontal.', '2006-07-19 19:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
