(2640532, 365493, 38032, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but like this for some reason ;] ... I wish my dear wife would pose for me in such a beautiful revealing way.  My critism is as follows:  The foot is a little too posed looking and is blown out so it distracts from the rest of the image.  The tatoos are not to my taste simply because it takes away the purity of the subject. Lastly, The hat and shadow above the eye make me want to adjust it for her.  This is nearly professional quality but the lighting simply needs to be a little more ... Oh heck, I''ve said enough. Very nicely done.</td>', 'I can''t help but like this for some reason ;] ... I wish my dear wife would pose for me in such a beautiful revealing way.  My critism is as follows:  The foot is a little too posed looking and is blown out so it distracts from the rest of the image.  The tatoos are not to my taste simply because it takes away the purity of the subject. Lastly, The hat and shadow above the eye make me want to adjust it for her.  This is nearly professional quality but the lighting simply needs to be a little more ... Oh heck, I''ve said enough. Very nicely done.', '2006-07-19 23:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
