(2641266, 364679, 43191, '<td valign="top">I have realized I''m quite a fan of portrait orriented scenery shots. Very nice.</td>', 'I have realized I''m quite a fan of portrait orriented scenery shots. Very nice.', '2006-07-20 03:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641292, 366000, 18367, '<td valign="top">The composition of this image leaves a tad to be desired, and I fear that  the  sun flares will have a negative impact on your score.  <br/> <br/>I do hope you will not think of me as unduly  harsh, but rather as one who is trying to help you avoid some of the  common pratfalls associated with photography.  You might consider investing in a polarizer filter, and read some of the materials dealing with the Rule of thirds and "Leading Lines"<br/> <br/>Good luck  to you  in the challenge.</td>', 'The composition of this image leaves a tad to be desired, and I fear that  the  sun flares will have a negative impact on your score.   I do hope you will not think of me as unduly  harsh, but rather as one who is trying to help you avoid some of the  common pratfalls associated with photography.  You might consider investing in a polarizer filter, and read some of the materials dealing with the Rule of thirds and "Leading Lines" Good luck  to you  in the challenge.', '2006-07-20 03:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641299, 364669, 18367, '<td valign="top">I am totally guessing here, but this looks like the bridge at Providence RI.<br/> <br/>The image might have been improved ever so slightly had you managed to incorporate more of the bridge in the image, and cropping out that area to the left of the Lighthouse, a factor which would have accentuated the leading lines, and have guided the viewers from the bridge to lighthouse  and sun.<br/> <br/>Great job nonetheless.</td>', 'I am totally guessing here, but this looks like the bridge at Providence RI. The image might have been improved ever so slightly had you managed to incorporate more of the bridge in the image, and cropping out that area to the left of the Lighthouse, a factor which would have accentuated the leading lines, and have guided the viewers from the bridge to lighthouse  and sun. Great job nonetheless.', '2006-07-20 03:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641319, 364913, 18367, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of one of the fastest birds on the beach.  I have no idea whether the shadow you captured occurred via luck or design, but it  most certainly  adds to the depiction of motion.<br/> <br/>Very well done.... I look forward to re-visiting this image after the contest as I hope to find out the particulars regarding this image.</td>', 'This is a great capture of one of the fastest birds on the beach.  I have no idea whether the shadow you captured occurred via luck or design, but it  most certainly  adds to the depiction of motion. Very well done.... I look forward to re-visiting this image after the contest as I hope to find out the particulars regarding this image.', '2006-07-20 04:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641334, 365939, 40430, '<td valign="top">the leaves on the left side are a bit distracting and if the boat or tree were just a bit off center it would be an even more compelling image, really like the colors and exposure.</td>', 'the leaves on the left side are a bit distracting and if the boat or tree were just a bit off center it would be an even more compelling image, really like the colors and exposure.', '2006-07-20 04:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641343, 365367, 61348, '<td valign="top">It should have been nice to have the entire reflection of the bird <br/>nice picture</td>', 'It should have been nice to have the entire reflection of the bird nice picture', '2006-07-20 04:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641349, 364562, 61348, '<td valign="top">to much oversaturated in my opinion</td>', 'to much oversaturated in my opinion', '2006-07-20 04:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641352, 364410, 61348, '<td valign="top">Is that in infrared?</td>', 'Is that in infrared?', '2006-07-20 04:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641432, 366172, 46853, '<td valign="top">Ahh Grótta.  Where nice.</td>', 'Ahh Grótta.  Where nice.', '2006-07-20 05:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
