(2642831, 365513, 60174, '<td valign="top">This would have recieved a higher score from me if you had managed to avoid having the people on the bridge.  The foreground is amazing.  Great colour, and I love the misty look.</td>', 'This would have recieved a higher score from me if you had managed to avoid having the people on the bridge.  The foreground is amazing.  Great colour, and I love the misty look.', '2006-07-20 15:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
