(2642915, 365889, 42100, '<td valign="top">The silky smooth water is wonderful, must of been a fairly long exposure.  Very nice composition and great color.  Well done!</td>', 'The silky smooth water is wonderful, must of been a fairly long exposure.  Very nice composition and great color.  Well done!', '2006-07-20 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
