(2643281, 365839, 47541, '<td valign="top">The concept is great and without the "island" it would be very good.  I find the OOF "island" distracts me too much from the sand in front.</td>', 'The concept is great and without the "island" it would be very good.  I find the OOF "island" distracts me too much from the sand in front.', '2006-07-20 18:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
