(2643288, 365300, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this with the colours bumped up a bit</td>', 'I''d like to see this with the colours bumped up a bit', '2006-07-20 18:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2643315, 365449, 33947, '<td valign="top">Perfect title!! Good lighting on the seals...particularly the three on the left..I feel like I can almost feel their fur. Nice capture of the watery sand above...beatiful shade of blue.</td>', 'Perfect title!! Good lighting on the seals...particularly the three on the left..I feel like I can almost feel their fur. Nice capture of the watery sand above...beatiful shade of blue.', '2006-07-20 18:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2643352, 365493, 46330, '<td valign="top">The pose following the curves of the background hills is great and I really like the angle of the hat and look on her face, but the blown highlights on the foot keep trying to pull my eye away and the amputated hand is a little distracting as well.  If you had just had her move a bit to get her foot out of the sun  and either adjusted your position or zoomed out slightly it would have been almost perfect.</td>', 'The pose following the curves of the background hills is great and I really like the angle of the hat and look on her face, but the blown highlights on the foot keep trying to pull my eye away and the amputated hand is a little distracting as well.  If you had just had her move a bit to get her foot out of the sun  and either adjusted your position or zoomed out slightly it would have been almost perfect.', '2006-07-20 18:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2643366, 365567, 47541, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped on the left - I''d like the cropping balanced more</td>', 'Too tightly cropped on the left - I''d like the cropping balanced more', '2006-07-20 18:55:26.000000', NULL, 1);
