(2644157, 364994, 38496, '<td valign="top">I love the misty look of this.  Very nice!<br/> <br/>Coming back to add this to my favorites and bump the score.  I really like it the softness, and the way the top of the bridge disappears into the clouds.</td>', 'I love the misty look of this.  Very nice! Coming back to add this to my favorites and bump the score.  I really like it the softness, and the way the top of the bridge disappears into the clouds.', '2006-07-20 21:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
