(2644220, 364746, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Did you get this from a boat? A long jetty? It feels like you must have been virtually in the water.</td>', 'Fantastic! Did you get this from a boat? A long jetty? It feels like you must have been virtually in the water.', '2006-07-20 21:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
