(2644227, 364013, 12733, '<td valign="top">Kid brother should cherish this shot, but the beach and water are way out of focus. Since the beach is supposed to be the subject, this is one time that shallow DOF is not really appropriate.</td>', 'Kid brother should cherish this shot, but the beach and water are way out of focus. Since the beach is supposed to be the subject, this is one time that shallow DOF is not really appropriate.', '2006-07-20 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
