(2646086, 365067, 61889, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo.  Although I imagine the bridge was loaded with cars and there was traffic at either end, you captured the peace and beauty of it all. I liked the person and the dog in there.. added a nice touch and gave it more life.</td>', 'I really liked this photo.  Although I imagine the bridge was loaded with cars and there was traffic at either end, you captured the peace and beauty of it all. I liked the person and the dog in there.. added a nice touch and gave it more life.', '2006-07-21 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
