(2646332, 364562, 54022, '<td valign="top">The sky is beautiful and the boy looks very intent on finding something...gr8 shot.</td>', 'The sky is beautiful and the boy looks very intent on finding something...gr8 shot.', '2006-07-21 14:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646346, 366128, 61557, '<td valign="top">The body is too blown out. Very nice though.</td>', 'The body is too blown out. Very nice though.', '2006-07-21 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646394, 365228, 56731, '<td valign="top">Great shot and I like the idea .... However Its just a little overexposed on the top left side (no big deal), but I would have given it a higher rating if you would have managed to focus more onto the center of the picture allowing the inspectors eyes to wonder from there and to explore the rest. This could have been achieved by bringing down the line between water and beach, and perhaps by changing ever so slightly the angle, moving the camera closer to the railings. I think the end of the railings and the beginning of the water should be in the center. I rated it a 7</td>', 'Great shot and I like the idea .... However Its just a little overexposed on the top left side (no big deal), but I would have given it a higher rating if you would have managed to focus more onto the center of the picture allowing the inspectors eyes to wonder from there and to explore the rest. This could have been achieved by bringing down the line between water and beach, and perhaps by changing ever so slightly the angle, moving the camera closer to the railings. I think the end of the railings and the beginning of the water should be in the center. I rated it a 7', '2006-07-21 15:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646403, 366086, 61679, '<td valign="top">The movement in the water gives this image a surreal feel to it.  The colors complement each other very well and the rocks provide a solid focal point to the composition.</td>', 'The movement in the water gives this image a surreal feel to it.  The colors complement each other very well and the rocks provide a solid focal point to the composition.', '2006-07-21 15:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646409, 363561, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is a pleasure to view and very well done.  I really like the reverse perspective of this image, as the rope lead my eyes to the almost hidden anchor after first enjoying the colors and the silhouette in the background.</td>', 'This image is a pleasure to view and very well done.  I really like the reverse perspective of this image, as the rope lead my eyes to the almost hidden anchor after first enjoying the colors and the silhouette in the background.', '2006-07-21 15:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646411, 366216, 56731, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and I love the contrast and composition. I''ve given it a 7, because there is a bit of an excitement missing on the top half of the picture. It would have been stunning if the water had been a brilliant blue or turquoise ...... as it is now it''s getting gradually more and more dull towards the top.</td>', 'Nice picture and I love the contrast and composition. I''ve given it a 7, because there is a bit of an excitement missing on the top half of the picture. It would have been stunning if the water had been a brilliant blue or turquoise ...... as it is now it''s getting gradually more and more dull towards the top.', '2006-07-21 15:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646422, 365707, 61679, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of people in this image enhances the grandeur of the rocks.  Very nice image.</td>', 'The inclusion of people in this image enhances the grandeur of the rocks.  Very nice image.', '2006-07-21 15:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
