(2646661, 366154, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is extremely hard to tell what it is. It looks like it might be a sand pattern.</td>', 'This is extremely hard to tell what it is. It looks like it might be a sand pattern.', '2006-07-21 16:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646672, 366011, 43088, '<td valign="top">I might have gone a little lighter for the background, but I do like it.</td>', 'I might have gone a little lighter for the background, but I do like it.', '2006-07-21 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646683, 365778, 43088, '<td valign="top">It is a nice sunset over the ocean but it could be better if the sun and the horizon were not so centered. Rule of thirds can help. An object of interest like some rocks or a person can also make sunset pictures more interesting. Most of us have seen and taken pictures of sunsets. Look for ways to make them different or give us something else to look at too. Make us want to look at the picture longer than a second or two.</td>', 'It is a nice sunset over the ocean but it could be better if the sun and the horizon were not so centered. Rule of thirds can help. An object of interest like some rocks or a person can also make sunset pictures more interesting. Most of us have seen and taken pictures of sunsets. Look for ways to make them different or give us something else to look at too. Make us want to look at the picture longer than a second or two.', '2006-07-21 16:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646688, 365367, 10720, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the mirror in the water, and the eyes look a bit soft, hard to tell since they are so tiny</td>', 'I would have liked to see the mirror in the water, and the eyes look a bit soft, hard to tell since they are so tiny', '2006-07-21 17:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646689, 362719, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the pano! It was probably difficult under those lighting conditions.</td>', 'Nice job on the pano! It was probably difficult under those lighting conditions.', '2006-07-21 17:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646692, 365165, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with good composition and using what is around you. Not everyone lives near a beach.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with good composition and using what is around you. Not everyone lives near a beach.', '2006-07-21 17:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646694, 366113, 10720, '<td valign="top">I don;t feel it particularly matches the challenge, I would have liked at least a title about underground river, or maybe river''s roots??? or some sign of water.  The picture itself has a lot of intersting textures and colors and I really like the dof. My eye keeps going to the top left corner as the lightest areas, but that is also the least interesting part of the picture.</td>', 'I don;t feel it particularly matches the challenge, I would have liked at least a title about underground river, or maybe river''s roots??? or some sign of water.  The picture itself has a lot of intersting textures and colors and I really like the dof. My eye keeps going to the top left corner as the lightest areas, but that is also the least interesting part of the picture.', '2006-07-21 17:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646695, 365861, 10720, '<td valign="top">nice action shot, good colours, lighting,</td>', 'nice action shot, good colours, lighting,', '2006-07-21 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646700, 365935, 43088, '<td valign="top">Well that is different. Points for creativity and technically excellent.</td>', 'Well that is different. Points for creativity and technically excellent.', '2006-07-21 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646701, 365686, 10720, '<td valign="top">The title told me what that pink lumps were but there is no part of the image that grabs me.  DOF is not enough to give the rocks in front more strength.</td>', 'The title told me what that pink lumps were but there is no part of the image that grabs me.  DOF is not enough to give the rocks in front more strength.', '2006-07-21 17:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646702, 364921, 43088, '<td valign="top">In my opinion it is cropped too tightly. Especially at the top.</td>', 'In my opinion it is cropped too tightly. Especially at the top.', '2006-07-21 17:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646712, 363561, 42516, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I''d just like to see it a tad brighter - 7</td>', 'Great shot, I''d just like to see it a tad brighter - 7', '2006-07-21 17:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646715, 365801, 43088, '<td valign="top">This has tons of potential that I do not think are quite realized. There is nothing special about the object in the foreground and it is directly centered. I think it is more of a distraction than a help in this case. The light is great. Maybe a more horizontal view with a bit more of the rocks on the right and a straighter horizon. Try it again- I am sure you can do it better!</td>', 'This has tons of potential that I do not think are quite realized. There is nothing special about the object in the foreground and it is directly centered. I think it is more of a distraction than a help in this case. The light is great. Maybe a more horizontal view with a bit more of the rocks on the right and a straighter horizon. Try it again- I am sure you can do it better!', '2006-07-21 17:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646720, 363561, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot! Great lighting and depth of focus with the anchor in the foreground leading our eye to the boat and the sun. The clouds also add lots of drama.</td>', 'This is an incredible shot! Great lighting and depth of focus with the anchor in the foreground leading our eye to the boat and the sun. The clouds also add lots of drama.', '2006-07-21 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646727, 366086, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is a dramatic beach. I like how the streaks in the sand/ water echo the clouds. You also have blue balancing the top of the picture with the bottom. Excellent job!</td>', 'This is a dramatic beach. I like how the streaks in the sand/ water echo the clouds. You also have blue balancing the top of the picture with the bottom. Excellent job!', '2006-07-21 17:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646732, 365848, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant. You may get some notes about the tree should be at the point of thirds, but I think in this case it works where it is. It helps balance the water in the lower right.</td>', 'Very simple and elegant. You may get some notes about the tree should be at the point of thirds, but I think in this case it works where it is. It helps balance the water in the lower right.', '2006-07-21 17:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646738, 365297, 43088, '<td valign="top">I think your horizon it too close to the top of the picture.  I might suggest getting closer to your subject too. He ls lost in the far corner and his looking out of the frame pushes him out further.</td>', 'I think your horizon it too close to the top of the picture.  I might suggest getting closer to your subject too. He ls lost in the far corner and his looking out of the frame pushes him out further.', '2006-07-21 17:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646747, 365930, 43088, '<td valign="top">I like the low angle to give you more reflection of the rock and the triangle also found in the clouds on top but this is still a hard picture to see. I am not sure. Maybe too dark?  How does it look in color? More contrast? You are definately going moody on this.</td>', 'I like the low angle to give you more reflection of the rock and the triangle also found in the clouds on top but this is still a hard picture to see. I am not sure. Maybe too dark?  How does it look in color? More contrast? You are definately going moody on this.', '2006-07-21 17:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646752, 365455, 56502, '<td valign="top">Spooky - I wonder if this was found like that or set up.</td>', 'Spooky - I wonder if this was found like that or set up.', '2006-07-21 17:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646757, 365839, 43088, '<td valign="top">Trying different thigs is good but what is the subject of this picture? The focus in the foreground is on...sand? We never make it back to the potentially interesting figures in the background.  A foreground subject to go along with the one in the background would help.</td>', 'Trying different thigs is good but what is the subject of this picture? The focus in the foreground is on...sand? We never make it back to the potentially interesting figures in the background.  A foreground subject to go along with the one in the background would help.', '2006-07-21 17:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646761, 363842, 43088, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Lighting and focus are perfect!</td>', 'Great action shot. Lighting and focus are perfect!', '2006-07-21 17:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646764, 363873, 43088, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Lunch.  The image will definately turn off some people, but a good image impacts people. Light is good but I am not sure about the composition.</td>', 'Mmm. Lunch.  The image will definately turn off some people, but a good image impacts people. Light is good but I am not sure about the composition.', '2006-07-21 17:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646767, 365240, 43088, '<td valign="top">Hey- use what you have! Not everyone lives by a beach! I love the ideal and execution!</td>', 'Hey- use what you have! Not everyone lives by a beach! I love the ideal and execution!', '2006-07-21 17:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646772, 365509, 43088, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice with the diagonal line of the surf and you have good textures involved, but the focus is a big problem here.</td>', 'Composition is nice with the diagonal line of the surf and you have good textures involved, but the focus is a big problem here.', '2006-07-21 17:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646776, 364622, 43088, '<td valign="top">I might have leaned the huts a bit more and lightened them some more.</td>', 'I might have leaned the huts a bit more and lightened them some more.', '2006-07-21 17:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2646778, 365369, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice, soft lighting. Good capture.</td>', 'Nice, soft lighting. Good capture.', '2006-07-21 17:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
