(2646796, 365851, 43088, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot from a good angle but I think it is cut off too much from the bottom. It would be nice to see the beach where they are.</td>', 'A lovely shot from a good angle but I think it is cut off too much from the bottom. It would be nice to see the beach where they are.', '2006-07-21 17:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
