(2647199, 365609, 57456, '<td valign="top">Diamond Head. I love Hawaii. Lived there for 5 years. I like the blueness of the water.</td>', 'Diamond Head. I love Hawaii. Lived there for 5 years. I like the blueness of the water.', '2006-07-21 20:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
