(2647222, 365301, 57456, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite photos by far. You have done a great job on this photo. I like everything about it. (9)</td>', 'One of my favorite photos by far. You have done a great job on this photo. I like everything about it. (9)', '2006-07-21 20:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
