(2648844, 363561, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Ignoring the halos around the boat silhouette this really is a marvellous shot - I just love the leading line of the anchor and the anchor itself and the  way the sun plays on the sand. The sky too is marvellous. This is a beautiful shot!</td>', 'Wow! Ignoring the halos around the boat silhouette this really is a marvellous shot - I just love the leading line of the anchor and the anchor itself and the  way the sun plays on the sand. The sky too is marvellous. This is a beautiful shot!', '2006-07-22 14:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
