(2648938, 365630, 40370, '<td valign="top">Tempting title. I love the composition and wouldn''t change the crop, unfortunately the foreground dirt/grass are less appealing than the beautiful water behind.</td>', 'Tempting title. I love the composition and wouldn''t change the crop, unfortunately the foreground dirt/grass are less appealing than the beautiful water behind.', '2006-07-22 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
