(2648943, 364159, 40370, '<td valign="top">A little bump in contrast and color saturation might help this glimpse over the dune. I like the composition but the colors are faded looking.</td>', 'A little bump in contrast and color saturation might help this glimpse over the dune. I like the composition but the colors are faded looking.', '2006-07-22 15:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
