(2648951, 363855, 40370, '<td valign="top">Interesting vertical perspective, not sure what is supposed to be in focus though. Since the sky is burned out and detail of the bird is lost, I might try a shallower DOF with sharp focus on the rocks.</td>', 'Interesting vertical perspective, not sure what is supposed to be in focus though. Since the sky is burned out and detail of the bird is lost, I might try a shallower DOF with sharp focus on the rocks.', '2006-07-22 15:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
