(2648958, 366192, 40370, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this last bit of day closer to the water, the waves look like they have more to offer in detail than the rocks.</td>', 'Would like to see this last bit of day closer to the water, the waves look like they have more to offer in detail than the rocks.', '2006-07-22 15:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
