(2649092, 366195, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice tone to the image and good subject material, but... (1) the horizon isn''t straight and (2) I think half the sky could have been cropped out.  The image appears too static being divided in the middle and there is more interest in the sand than the plain sky.</td>', 'Nice tone to the image and good subject material, but... (1) the horizon isn''t straight and (2) I think half the sky could have been cropped out.  The image appears too static being divided in the middle and there is more interest in the sand than the plain sky.', '2006-07-22 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
