(2649249, 366086, 62554, '<td valign="top">Soft and pastel colours for a sense of relaxation.  Good DoF with the foreground interest and the receding tide lines leading the eye to the rest of the image.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Soft and pastel colours for a sense of relaxation.  Good DoF with the foreground interest and the receding tide lines leading the eye to the rest of the image.  Nicely done!', '2006-07-22 16:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
