(2649360, 363711, 33352, '<td valign="top">The effect is good and creative, the pink in the mist of the background adds just the right touch of color.</td>', 'The effect is good and creative, the pink in the mist of the background adds just the right touch of color.', '2006-07-22 17:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2649363, 362668, 62554, '<td valign="top">Cute, sweet and innocent. If only the horizon was level.  Would work well also if the horizon was further askew but here it is just in limbo.  People pictures also work better if there is more space in front of the subject than behind - so it looks like they''re walking"into" the picture and not "out" of the picture.  But a picture to treasure anyway.</td>', 'Cute, sweet and innocent. If only the horizon was level.  Would work well also if the horizon was further askew but here it is just in limbo.  People pictures also work better if there is more space in front of the subject than behind - so it looks like they''re walking"into" the picture and not "out" of the picture.  But a picture to treasure anyway.', '2006-07-22 17:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2649365, 364100, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good use of the beach to lead the viewer into the photo,colors well done...</td>', 'Good use of the beach to lead the viewer into the photo,colors well done...', '2006-07-22 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
