(2650876, 365707, 75713, '<td valign="top">very well photographed - 8</td>', 'very well photographed - 8', '2006-07-23 09:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650878, 365198, 75713, '<td valign="top">That is the best title I ever read - nicely photographed too!</td>', 'That is the best title I ever read - nicely photographed too!', '2006-07-23 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650879, 366078, 75713, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was an excellent choice - 8</td>', 'B&W was an excellent choice - 8', '2006-07-23 09:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650880, 364655, 75713, '<td valign="top">very well done - back to bump to 9</td>', 'very well done - back to bump to 9', '2006-07-23 09:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650881, 364725, 75713, '<td valign="top">prehistoric bones - that''s what comes to mind as I view your photo... crisp focus - well photographed</td>', 'prehistoric bones - that''s what comes to mind as I view your photo... crisp focus - well photographed', '2006-07-23 09:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650917, 364778, 62554, '<td valign="top">No focal point of interest for me.  Flat lighting due to midday sun.  Shoot later and from different angle.</td>', 'No focal point of interest for me.  Flat lighting due to midday sun.  Shoot later and from different angle.', '2006-07-23 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650922, 364880, 60698, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this Photo! Great!</td>', 'I love everything about this Photo! Great!', '2006-07-23 10:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650923, 365303, 62554, '<td valign="top">Very simply done and a great result.  Lighting is good in this instance and ground texture evident.  Well placed withing the frame.  My only nit-pick is the green debris just above the imprint.  Otherwise, a well executed shot (been done many times before but still good).</td>', 'Very simply done and a great result.  Lighting is good in this instance and ground texture evident.  Well placed withing the frame.  My only nit-pick is the green debris just above the imprint.  Otherwise, a well executed shot (been done many times before but still good).', '2006-07-23 10:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650925, 362614, 62554, '<td valign="top">Apart from the skewed horizon, a lovely "painted" image (if not somewhat dark with the mysterious figure low right!!) with good tones and a definite story within.  Very pleasing to view.</td>', 'Apart from the skewed horizon, a lovely "painted" image (if not somewhat dark with the mysterious figure low right!!) with good tones and a definite story within.  Very pleasing to view.', '2006-07-23 10:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650928, 365369, 62554, '<td valign="top">Not bad, a little crowded with vessels (unavoidable?) and the darkness of the main subject directs the eyes.  A little too dark for me.  Good DoF and soft light.</td>', 'Not bad, a little crowded with vessels (unavoidable?) and the darkness of the main subject directs the eyes.  A little too dark for me.  Good DoF and soft light.', '2006-07-23 10:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650931, 364824, 62554, '<td valign="top">Crop is a little too tight for me, with the loss of the bird in the foreground distracting.  Looks a little out of focus (camera shake??) and the central subject cannot compete with the masses on top.  The bird at top right squawking is a better main subject.</td>', 'Crop is a little too tight for me, with the loss of the bird in the foreground distracting.  Looks a little out of focus (camera shake??) and the central subject cannot compete with the masses on top.  The bird at top right squawking is a better main subject.', '2006-07-23 10:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650933, 365801, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but ... fill flash too strong in forground (almost gives it a split view with the dark band before the water) ... and the horizon is skewed!  Generally a good idea but needs a little work. Composition too rigid and doesn''t flow.</td>', 'Nice try, but ... fill flash too strong in forground (almost gives it a split view with the dark band before the water) ... and the horizon is skewed!  Generally a good idea but needs a little work. Composition too rigid and doesn''t flow.', '2006-07-23 10:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650936, 363907, 62554, '<td valign="top">Only one negative here ... I''d crop tighter into a panorama shot by losing half the foreground which will bring the yellow skater (?) into the picture more.  Beautiful colours balanced well with the green roof.</td>', 'Only one negative here ... I''d crop tighter into a panorama shot by losing half the foreground which will bring the yellow skater (?) into the picture more.  Beautiful colours balanced well with the green roof.', '2006-07-23 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650939, 365484, 62554, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of patterns.  More texture could be achieved by shooting later in the day.</td>', 'Beautiful use of patterns.  More texture could be achieved by shooting later in the day.', '2006-07-23 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650943, 364943, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice try!  This shot would have worked better if the model was further to the left (as I look at it) giving more story on the right, and keeping the viewer focused in a specific area.  As is, the eyes wander from left to right around her.  Again, flat lighting as a result of shooting in midday sun.</td>', 'Nice try!  This shot would have worked better if the model was further to the left (as I look at it) giving more story on the right, and keeping the viewer focused in a specific area.  As is, the eyes wander from left to right around her.  Again, flat lighting as a result of shooting in midday sun.', '2006-07-23 10:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650947, 365804, 62554, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  Great composition, a story within and great crispness.  Worth framing.</td>', 'This is a great shot!  Great composition, a story within and great crispness.  Worth framing.', '2006-07-23 10:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650949, 365878, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard!  Straighten that horizon!</td>', 'Nice postcard!  Straighten that horizon!', '2006-07-23 10:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650956, 365707, 62554, '<td valign="top">Very nice, crystal clear sharpness.  The eye is simply drawn from the bottom of the image to the top.  Beautifully exposed.</td>', 'Very nice, crystal clear sharpness.  The eye is simply drawn from the bottom of the image to the top.  Beautifully exposed.', '2006-07-23 10:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650979, 365493, 62554, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at the WOW factor worthy of comment.  I like the way her pose mirrors the hill side and the left leg is bent up, although the foot is blown out in the hilites.  Well balanced light without blowing out the hills.  Hint with nudes:  try to avoid clothing lines by having the model wear loose fitting clothing for 1/2 hour before shoot.</td>', 'Good attempt at the WOW factor worthy of comment.  I like the way her pose mirrors the hill side and the left leg is bent up, although the foot is blown out in the hilites.  Well balanced light without blowing out the hills.  Hint with nudes:  try to avoid clothing lines by having the model wear loose fitting clothing for 1/2 hour before shoot.', '2006-07-23 10:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650984, 365506, 62554, '<td valign="top">This works very well!  The viewer is drawn immediately to the people, and then, because of their head position, directly to the vessels.  Beautiful tonal range with just the right amount of DoF.  Congrats!</td>', 'This works very well!  The viewer is drawn immediately to the people, and then, because of their head position, directly to the vessels.  Beautiful tonal range with just the right amount of DoF.  Congrats!', '2006-07-23 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650993, 364914, 62554, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot that works with this - the yellow umbrella diffusing the afternoon sun, the relaxed look of the model, the composition (model looking "into" the picture) and the texture of the sand to say but a few.  Also great sharpness.  Very, very nice.</td>', 'There''s a lot that works with this - the yellow umbrella diffusing the afternoon sun, the relaxed look of the model, the composition (model looking "into" the picture) and the texture of the sand to say but a few.  Also great sharpness.  Very, very nice.', '2006-07-23 11:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650994, 363893, 62554, '<td valign="top">Great use of DoF.</td>', 'Great use of DoF.', '2006-07-23 11:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650996, 365719, 62554, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely ... we''ve all had this happen to us.</td>', 'Simply lovely ... we''ve all had this happen to us.', '2006-07-23 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2650998, 362710, 62554, '<td valign="top">Subject too dominating for me.  Step back a little and include a bit more of the immediate surrounds - not much but more than is there now.</td>', 'Subject too dominating for me.  Step back a little and include a bit more of the immediate surrounds - not much but more than is there now.', '2006-07-23 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651000, 366006, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but looks a little soft in the focus.</td>', 'Nice composition but looks a little soft in the focus.', '2006-07-23 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651003, 364336, 62554, '<td valign="top">Too regimented - move point of focus and move subject from centre of frame.</td>', 'Too regimented - move point of focus and move subject from centre of frame.', '2006-07-23 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651004, 363223, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice view massively let down by massively skewed horizon.</td>', 'Nice view massively let down by massively skewed horizon.', '2006-07-23 11:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651011, 363842, 62554, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  The image reeks of action and anticipation.  Beautifully cropped and crystal clear - late afternoon shot with the shadows adding to the story.  Just great!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  The image reeks of action and anticipation.  Beautifully cropped and crystal clear - late afternoon shot with the shadows adding to the story.  Just great!', '2006-07-23 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651012, 365187, 62554, '<td valign="top">Ummm ....</td>', 'Ummm ....', '2006-07-23 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651014, 365356, 62554, '<td valign="top">I love street scenes.  This is well balanced and reminiscent of old days around a fire hydrant or garden hose - simple fun!  The lack of subject detail de-personalizes the person making the image easier to embrace.</td>', 'I love street scenes.  This is well balanced and reminiscent of old days around a fire hydrant or garden hose - simple fun!  The lack of subject detail de-personalizes the person making the image easier to embrace.', '2006-07-23 11:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651032, 365897, 62554, '<td valign="top">Cute .. if not very sad!</td>', 'Cute .. if not very sad!', '2006-07-23 11:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651040, 363561, 62554, '<td valign="top">A little more detail in the anchor would have given a higher rating</td>', 'A little more detail in the anchor would have given a higher rating', '2006-07-23 11:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651049, 365900, 62554, '<td valign="top">Move the main subject away from the centre of the frame ...</td>', 'Move the main subject away from the centre of the frame ...', '2006-07-23 11:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651051, 366015, 62554, '<td valign="top">A great attempt but needs crystal clear sharpness to work well ..</td>', 'A great attempt but needs crystal clear sharpness to work well ..', '2006-07-23 11:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651055, 364633, 62554, '<td valign="top">Classic shot with long exposure ...</td>', 'Classic shot with long exposure ...', '2006-07-23 11:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651062, 366023, 50357, '<td valign="top">crisp, colorful, very nice!</td>', 'crisp, colorful, very nice!', '2006-07-23 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651065, 364380, 50357, '<td valign="top">Colors are beautiful, reflection is beautiful!</td>', 'Colors are beautiful, reflection is beautiful!', '2006-07-23 11:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
