(2654549, 365878, 56731, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture and I can just see it in a holiday brochure advertising for a Hawaiian trip... <br/> <br/>Meeting the Challenge 0-1-2 = 2<br/>Overall look, feel and composition 0-1-2 = 2<br/>Creativity 0-1-2 = 1<br/>Quality and execution 0-1-2 = 2<br/>WOW effect and first impression 0-1-2 = 1<br/> <br/>Final : 8</td>', 'Lovely picture and I can just see it in a holiday brochure advertising for a Hawaiian trip...  Meeting the Challenge 0-1-2 = 2Overall look, feel and composition 0-1-2 = 2Creativity 0-1-2 = 1Quality and execution 0-1-2 = 2WOW effect and first impression 0-1-2 = 1 Final : 8', '2006-07-24 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654564, 365267, 56731, '<td valign="top">This picture seems to be a little bit unbalanced and by rotating the image slightly clockwise could give it a better feel. Its all about balance unless you shoot a perspective photo. <br/> <br/>Meeting the Challenge 0-1-2 = 1 doesn''t have the beach feeling that I was looking for<br/>Overall look, feel and composition 0-1-2 = 1 <br/>Creativity 0-1-2 = 1 seems just like to photo to me with no great effort on the compositing <br/>Quality and execution 0-1-2 = 1 the colors could be stronger and feels a bit bland<br/>WOW effect and first impression 0-1-2 = 0 It doesn''t quite pop out enough to make me excited <br/> <br/>Final : 4</td>', 'This picture seems to be a little bit unbalanced and by rotating the image slightly clockwise could give it a better feel. Its all about balance unless you shoot a perspective photo.  Meeting the Challenge 0-1-2 = 1 doesn''t have the beach feeling that I was looking forOverall look, feel and composition 0-1-2 = 1 Creativity 0-1-2 = 1 seems just like to photo to me with no great effort on the compositing Quality and execution 0-1-2 = 1 the colors could be stronger and feels a bit blandWOW effect and first impression 0-1-2 = 0 It doesn''t quite pop out enough to make me excited  Final : 4', '2006-07-24 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
