(2655853, 365165, 57519, '<td valign="top">Funky clouds. I''m willing to bet you can''t wait to go to a real beach. Believe me, I can relate!</td>', 'Funky clouds. I''m willing to bet you can''t wait to go to a real beach. Believe me, I can relate!', '2006-07-24 17:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655908, 363744, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good shot but I wish you would of allowed for some ambient lighting on the foreground giving it more texture.</td>', 'Good shot but I wish you would of allowed for some ambient lighting on the foreground giving it more texture.', '2006-07-24 17:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655909, 365861, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice playful shot. Good lighting and motion capture.</td>', 'Nice playful shot. Good lighting and motion capture.', '2006-07-24 17:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655922, 364380, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture, reflections, and color on the beach and water. The sky is a little off in color, IMO. Looks more "C" than blue. But still a good beach shot. Something that one would expect to find.</td>', 'Very nice texture, reflections, and color on the beach and water. The sky is a little off in color, IMO. Looks more "C" than blue. But still a good beach shot. Something that one would expect to find.', '2006-07-24 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655933, 365878, 40819, '<td valign="top">Excellent light balance between the background and the subject, sharp focus and lots of color make this one of my fav''s. Great work.</td>', 'Excellent light balance between the background and the subject, sharp focus and lots of color make this one of my fav''s. Great work.', '2006-07-24 18:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655937, 365805, 40819, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the sky and how it reflects on the wet sand. I don''t exactly like the dog in the image, you didn''t need that, however the fact that you got the reflection of the person and dog in the backwash of a wave makes up for the dog being there. Excellent work.</td>', 'I love the color of the sky and how it reflects on the wet sand. I don''t exactly like the dog in the image, you didn''t need that, however the fact that you got the reflection of the person and dog in the backwash of a wave makes up for the dog being there. Excellent work.', '2006-07-24 18:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655940, 363474, 40819, '<td valign="top">Yep God did it and you caught it in your camera, the best I''ve seen so far. Just love it.</td>', 'Yep God did it and you caught it in your camera, the best I''ve seen so far. Just love it.', '2006-07-24 18:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655946, 364737, 40819, '<td valign="top">Wow you got something here.</td>', 'Wow you got something here.', '2006-07-24 18:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655955, 365726, 40819, '<td valign="top">As a thumbnail I thought this would blow me away, when I look closer it somehow loses it''s charm. It doesn''t look real to me. Would the sand really be that color if I was looking at it standing right next to you? It is pretty but something is missing for my liking. It is a good picture though so your score should reflect around what I am giving it. By far above average.</td>', 'As a thumbnail I thought this would blow me away, when I look closer it somehow loses it''s charm. It doesn''t look real to me. Would the sand really be that color if I was looking at it standing right next to you? It is pretty but something is missing for my liking. It is a good picture though so your score should reflect around what I am giving it. By far above average.', '2006-07-24 18:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655966, 363561, 40819, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2006-07-24 18:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
