(2656829, 363580, 12733, '<td valign="top">The rusty color, the unusual shape and the contrast with the background work well together. Great sharp DOF; this is not a time for bokeh (background blur).</td>', 'The rusty color, the unusual shape and the contrast with the background work well together. Great sharp DOF; this is not a time for bokeh (background blur).', '2006-07-24 23:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
