(2656857, 363048, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but if the beach is the main subject, it should be in focus. Bokeh (soft background) isn''t always appropriate.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but if the beach is the main subject, it should be in focus. Bokeh (soft background) isn''t always appropriate.', '2006-07-24 23:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656861, 365642, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it needs to be larger to be seen. While the full 640 pixels allowed won''t fit on some screens for a vertical shot, you should try to fill the vertical distance on the screen. My monitor works best at 640 wide for horizontal shots and about 520 deep (maybe 280 to 300 wide plus or minus) for verticals.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it needs to be larger to be seen. While the full 640 pixels allowed won''t fit on some screens for a vertical shot, you should try to fill the vertical distance on the screen. My monitor works best at 640 wide for horizontal shots and about 520 deep (maybe 280 to 300 wide plus or minus) for verticals.', '2006-07-24 23:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656865, 365518, 12733, '<td valign="top">pretty sunset and silhouettes.</td>', 'pretty sunset and silhouettes.', '2006-07-24 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656871, 365916, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, and the lighthouse provides a point of interest. I like the use of the long narrow crop for a shot like this.</td>', 'Nice sunset, and the lighthouse provides a point of interest. I like the use of the long narrow crop for a shot like this.', '2006-07-24 23:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
