(2657152, 365609, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like that the camera is taken into the water here.<br/>The scene is great.</td>', 'I like that the camera is taken into the water here.The scene is great.', '2006-07-25 01:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657261, 364081, 61573, '<td valign="top">Great light composition.  The contrast is excellent and the smooth reflective water in the foreground give the pic a surreal feel.  Color saturation is heavy but it works really well!  Great shot!</td>', 'Great light composition.  The contrast is excellent and the smooth reflective water in the foreground give the pic a surreal feel.  Color saturation is heavy but it works really well!  Great shot!', '2006-07-25 02:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657263, 366023, 61573, '<td valign="top">Intense color and clarity make this a winner.  Nice overall warm tone and the light is just right.</td>', 'Intense color and clarity make this a winner.  Nice overall warm tone and the light is just right.', '2006-07-25 02:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657265, 365240, 61573, '<td valign="top">Makes me wonder...."what is he thinking?"  The composition of the shot is okay but the subject matter gets a ton of extra points!</td>', 'Makes me wonder...."what is he thinking?"  The composition of the shot is okay but the subject matter gets a ton of extra points!', '2006-07-25 02:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657268, 365916, 61573, '<td valign="top">Nice panorama.  Decent composition.  I would have wanted the shoreline higher or lower perhaps...and push the color saturations a bit but overall a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice panorama.  Decent composition.  I would have wanted the shoreline higher or lower perhaps...and push the color saturations a bit but overall a nice shot.', '2006-07-25 02:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657269, 365342, 61573, '<td valign="top">Very cool.....the motion of the misty wave and the stark gray colors are punctuated by the red from the trap.  Nice.  The only thing I could critique is that I would have moved the trap a little more to the left in the frame.  Other than that minor thing this is a cool shot!</td>', 'Very cool.....the motion of the misty wave and the stark gray colors are punctuated by the red from the trap.  Nice.  The only thing I could critique is that I would have moved the trap a little more to the left in the frame.  Other than that minor thing this is a cool shot!', '2006-07-25 02:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657270, 363265, 61573, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking and serene all in the same pic.</td>', 'Breathtaking and serene all in the same pic.', '2006-07-25 02:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657272, 366020, 61573, '<td valign="top">Not sure this conveys the challenge subject all that well but what a friggin'' killer picture!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Not sure this conveys the challenge subject all that well but what a friggin'' killer picture!!!!!!!!!!!', '2006-07-25 02:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
