(2657286, 364349, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground but the background seems flat.</td>', 'I like the foreground but the background seems flat.', '2006-07-25 02:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657290, 365664, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the detail of the image is very bad. I would suggest using the max of 150k when submitting photograph to get the best quality. Yours is at 38k.</td>', 'Nice composition but the detail of the image is very bad. I would suggest using the max of 150k when submitting photograph to get the best quality. Yours is at 38k.', '2006-07-25 02:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657294, 363891, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition but I would of loved to see the flower with more pop. They seem to be very soft focused and not sharp. Maybe the wind was blowing. The border a little large for this picture IMO. Nice DOF and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice composition but I would of loved to see the flower with more pop. They seem to be very soft focused and not sharp. Maybe the wind was blowing. The border a little large for this picture IMO. Nice DOF and lighting.', '2006-07-25 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657297, 365601, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice! Good texture and reflection along with color. Would of liked to seen a lower point of view. But good shot.</td>', 'Nice! Good texture and reflection along with color. Would of liked to seen a lower point of view. But good shot.', '2006-07-25 02:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657303, 366086, 61573, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  The squigglies make all the difference.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Awesome!  The squigglies make all the difference.  Nice capture!', '2006-07-25 02:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657305, 365119, 22970, '<td valign="top">Seems odd with just the real &amp; rod with no one sitting there. I think if you could of had a person in the picture it would of added to the photograph since most people that go fishing do so to be alone or just be in a peaceful place. You photograph offers a nice peaceful view and the human element would of given it depth. The greens seem to be a bit over saturated but the lighting, DOF, and focus are good.</td>', 'Seems odd with just the real & rod with no one sitting there. I think if you could of had a person in the picture it would of added to the photograph since most people that go fishing do so to be alone or just be in a peaceful place. You photograph offers a nice peaceful view and the human element would of given it depth. The greens seem to be a bit over saturated but the lighting, DOF, and focus are good.', '2006-07-25 02:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657307, 365507, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and post processing. Nice emotional surreal feel. The beveled border is a bit distracting but still a good overall shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot and post processing. Nice emotional surreal feel. The beveled border is a bit distracting but still a good overall shot.', '2006-07-25 02:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657312, 366088, 22970, '<td valign="top">The composition is not good for an abstract shot of this nature. As I look at the photograph my eyes focus on the brown and goes directly of the page to the left and right. I think a more straight on view would of been better.</td>', 'The composition is not good for an abstract shot of this nature. As I look at the photograph my eyes focus on the brown and goes directly of the page to the left and right. I think a more straight on view would of been better.', '2006-07-25 02:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657318, 366189, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and tone to your photograph. I like the secondary reflection at the bottom. The one thing that bothers me is no detail in the landscape. Kind of disappointing because this is a good shot. Just something in the foreground that would capture my attention would of made this shot great.</td>', 'Very nice color and tone to your photograph. I like the secondary reflection at the bottom. The one thing that bothers me is no detail in the landscape. Kind of disappointing because this is a good shot. Just something in the foreground that would capture my attention would of made this shot great.', '2006-07-25 03:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657328, 366198, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! At first it looks over sharpened or to contrasty but the more I look at it the better I like the look. There are a few thing I feel would of made this a great shot. One, get rid of the sea plant at the bottom of the picture. Being very sharp with the rocks it just gets compressed into the photograph. Two, If possible move the box figure off the beach. Three,Even though the horizon may not be tilted I would of lined up the horizon with the wave pattern. and Four, may a little more blue saturation. I think then it would of given us a very good deserted beach shot.<br/> <br/>With all that said it is still a nice photograph.</td>', 'Nice shot! At first it looks over sharpened or to contrasty but the more I look at it the better I like the look. There are a few thing I feel would of made this a great shot. One, get rid of the sea plant at the bottom of the picture. Being very sharp with the rocks it just gets compressed into the photograph. Two, If possible move the box figure off the beach. Three,Even though the horizon may not be tilted I would of lined up the horizon with the wave pattern. and Four, may a little more blue saturation. I think then it would of given us a very good deserted beach shot. With all that said it is still a nice photograph.', '2006-07-25 03:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657332, 366107, 22970, '<td valign="top">I would of cropped out the object in the bottom left.</td>', 'I would of cropped out the object in the bottom left.', '2006-07-25 03:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
