(2658275, 364081, 62554, '<td valign="top">Great colour and timing of shot.  A wide panorama including the rock at right would have worked wonders.  Easer said than done ...</td>', 'Great colour and timing of shot.  A wide panorama including the rock at right would have worked wonders.  Easer said than done ...', '2006-07-25 12:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658278, 365883, 50618, '<td valign="top">wild colors.  would like more detail</td>', 'wild colors.  would like more detail', '2006-07-25 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658279, 365224, 62554, '<td valign="top">Needed to be isolated from the larger branch behind.</td>', 'Needed to be isolated from the larger branch behind.', '2006-07-25 12:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658286, 363789, 62554, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t mentioned, I may not have noticed it!  Good colours, foreground interest and detail.  Compo fine too, but, the title suggests the tower to be the main subject, which it is not for me.  Consider ...</td>', 'If it wasn''t mentioned, I may not have noticed it!  Good colours, foreground interest and detail.  Compo fine too, but, the title suggests the tower to be the main subject, which it is not for me.  Consider ...', '2006-07-25 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658288, 365779, 50618, '<td valign="top">do you have a shot with more of the cliff in the back?</td>', 'do you have a shot with more of the cliff in the back?', '2006-07-25 12:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658289, 365580, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset with good colour and compo.</td>', 'Nice sunset with good colour and compo.', '2006-07-25 12:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658292, 365512, 62554, '<td valign="top">The red (orange??) hat breaks this up nicely and is well positioned in the frame.  A little more detail and fill light on the competitors would have helped.  DoF keeps the interest where it should be.</td>', 'The red (orange??) hat breaks this up nicely and is well positioned in the frame.  A little more detail and fill light on the competitors would have helped.  DoF keeps the interest where it should be.', '2006-07-25 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658296, 365175, 50618, '<td valign="top">could be my monitor, but the driftwood is too centered to not have much detail.  love the color scheme.  water is nice too.</td>', 'could be my monitor, but the driftwood is too centered to not have much detail.  love the color scheme.  water is nice too.', '2006-07-25 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658298, 365889, 49380, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! The gradient on the water is awesome!</td>', 'Beautiful capture! The gradient on the water is awesome!', '2006-07-25 12:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658299, 364135, 50618, '<td valign="top">too gooey.</td>', 'too gooey.', '2006-07-25 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658301, 364219, 49380, '<td valign="top">Very intresting subject! Great composition, love it!</td>', 'Very intresting subject! Great composition, love it!', '2006-07-25 12:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658302, 365389, 50618, '<td valign="top">that''s sweet.  nice use of muted colors.</td>', 'that''s sweet.  nice use of muted colors.', '2006-07-25 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658303, 365621, 62554, '<td valign="top">And the message is ..... picture is a touch too soft for me.  It''s good composition and well balanced but the bottle is not sharp enough.  Hand held shot?</td>', 'And the message is ..... picture is a touch too soft for me.  It''s good composition and well balanced but the bottle is not sharp enough.  Hand held shot?', '2006-07-25 12:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658305, 364778, 50618, '<td valign="top">light is a little hard and flat.  but very sharp</td>', 'light is a little hard and flat.  but very sharp', '2006-07-25 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658307, 365384, 49380, '<td valign="top">Great capture, he is adorable!</td>', 'Great capture, he is adorable!', '2006-07-25 12:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658311, 364706, 62554, '<td valign="top">Great attempt at panning but the bird wins.  Admittedly it shows speed and energy as is, but the eye always tries to find a sharp point somewhere in an image - this has none.</td>', 'Great attempt at panning but the bird wins.  Admittedly it shows speed and energy as is, but the eye always tries to find a sharp point somewhere in an image - this has none.', '2006-07-25 12:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658314, 365897, 50618, '<td valign="top">leave a little room in front for someone to shoot into.</td>', 'leave a little room in front for someone to shoot into.', '2006-07-25 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658315, 365750, 50618, '<td valign="top">just don''t shake off on me!  very in your face.</td>', 'just don''t shake off on me!  very in your face.', '2006-07-25 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658316, 366148, 49380, '<td valign="top">Great colors here, love it!</td>', 'Great colors here, love it!', '2006-07-25 12:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658323, 365678, 62554, '<td valign="top">The idea was sound but the calm water and subsquent mirro image makes the picture too noisy - my eye doesn''t know where to go.  A little wind rippling the water would distort the mirrored image to give it substance and a surface.  Good effort none the less.</td>', 'The idea was sound but the calm water and subsquent mirro image makes the picture too noisy - my eye doesn''t know where to go.  A little wind rippling the water would distort the mirrored image to give it substance and a surface.  Good effort none the less.', '2006-07-25 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658328, 362624, 62554, '<td valign="top">With a straighter horizon-line and a little more punch in the red, this would have greater strength.  Nice eye.</td>', 'With a straighter horizon-line and a little more punch in the red, this would have greater strength.  Nice eye.', '2006-07-25 12:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658331, 365683, 62554, '<td valign="top">By concentrating on detail under the construction, you''ve blown out the left.  Nice try.</td>', 'By concentrating on detail under the construction, you''ve blown out the left.  Nice try.', '2006-07-25 12:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658333, 362577, 62554, '<td valign="top">Action all the way ..</td>', 'Action all the way ..', '2006-07-25 12:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658343, 364605, 62554, '<td valign="top">Nice ..</td>', 'Nice ..', '2006-07-25 12:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658345, 364195, 62554, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range and well compositioned.</td>', 'Great tonal range and well compositioned.', '2006-07-25 12:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658349, 363911, 62554, '<td valign="top">Lovely and sharp.</td>', 'Lovely and sharp.', '2006-07-25 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658356, 366209, 62554, '<td valign="top">Yeh!!</td>', 'Yeh!!', '2006-07-25 12:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658384, 365892, 50618, '<td valign="top">SMALL AND OUT OF FOCUS.  MAYBE THE ORIGINAL IS DIFFERENT.  THE LIGHT LOOKS LIKE IT COULD BE INTERESTING.</td>', 'SMALL AND OUT OF FOCUS.  MAYBE THE ORIGINAL IS DIFFERENT.  THE LIGHT LOOKS LIKE IT COULD BE INTERESTING.', '2006-07-25 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658399, 366208, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I loved this.  The clarity in the water, the perspective, the colors, the illusion of distance, the movement of the water, the grandeur of the sky, the rays of light.  It all works together and makes this one of my top 3 in this challenge.</td>', 'Great job!  I loved this.  The clarity in the water, the perspective, the colors, the illusion of distance, the movement of the water, the grandeur of the sky, the rays of light.  It all works together and makes this one of my top 3 in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658400, 364081, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Great used of color, love the reflection!  I''m just a bit overwhelmed by all of the blue, which kept it from getting a 10.  Gave you a 9.</td>', 'Great job!  Great used of color, love the reflection!  I''m just a bit overwhelmed by all of the blue, which kept it from getting a 10.  Gave you a 9.', '2006-07-25 12:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658401, 365788, 56579, '<td valign="top">photo is too small</td>', 'photo is too small', '2006-07-25 12:50:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2658405, 363561, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I can just feel the heat of the Indian climate, and feel the sun setting in this one!  Loved the sky and the perspective and angle of the anchor.  I feel like if I stepped onto that sand, it would melt away beneath my feet.  I gave you a 9.</td>', 'Great job!  I can just feel the heat of the Indian climate, and feel the sun setting in this one!  Loved the sky and the perspective and angle of the anchor.  I feel like if I stepped onto that sand, it would melt away beneath my feet.  I gave you a 9.', '2006-07-25 12:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658412, 365939, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I found this to be one of my favorites in this challenge because I feel part of the setting, I love the sky, the colors in it are just gorgeous.  I love the subtle-ness of the water, being a minor part of the whole scene, but works so beautifully.  I love the movement in the sand, it''s as though a million feet have danced on that beach.  And I love the solitude that is created by the boat and single palm tree.  I gave this a 9, because it met the challenge 100% in what my idea of a beach shot should be.  I''d give you a 10, but it wasn''t my favorite out of all of the shots.</td>', 'Great job!  I found this to be one of my favorites in this challenge because I feel part of the setting, I love the sky, the colors in it are just gorgeous.  I love the subtle-ness of the water, being a minor part of the whole scene, but works so beautifully.  I love the movement in the sand, it''s as though a million feet have danced on that beach.  And I love the solitude that is created by the boat and single palm tree.  I gave this a 9, because it met the challenge 100% in what my idea of a beach shot should be.  I''d give you a 10, but it wasn''t my favorite out of all of the shots.', '2006-07-25 12:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658418, 366023, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Very crisp and clear, great color!  I feel as though the swirl has movement, and is almost an optical illusion.  I love the smoothness of the stones and the wet feeling of the sand and stones.  I am giving this a 9, because it meets the challenge head on in my opinion of what it''s all about, but it''s not my favorite out of all the entries, so it''s not a 10.  It''s right up there though!</td>', 'Great job!  Very crisp and clear, great color!  I feel as though the swirl has movement, and is almost an optical illusion.  I love the smoothness of the stones and the wet feeling of the sand and stones.  I am giving this a 9, because it meets the challenge head on in my opinion of what it''s all about, but it''s not my favorite out of all the entries, so it''s not a 10.  It''s right up there though!', '2006-07-25 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658427, 365897, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I''ve voted this up, and then voted it down, then voted it up again, and now I''m voting it up once more.  I love the light-hearted humor in this, the remebrance of childhood that it inflicts, and it''s originality in light of the challenge''s theme.  I can remember my brother bringing his toy soldiers to the beach with him and setting them up, which is why this meets the challenge in my eyes.  I''m giving you an 8 for this one.  It''s not the most beautiful of shots in this challenge, but you deserve a score for meeting the challenge, and for the entertainment factor that this one gave me.</td>', 'Great job!  I''ve voted this up, and then voted it down, then voted it up again, and now I''m voting it up once more.  I love the light-hearted humor in this, the remebrance of childhood that it inflicts, and it''s originality in light of the challenge''s theme.  I can remember my brother bringing his toy soldiers to the beach with him and setting them up, which is why this meets the challenge in my eyes.  I''m giving you an 8 for this one.  It''s not the most beautiful of shots in this challenge, but you deserve a score for meeting the challenge, and for the entertainment factor that this one gave me.', '2006-07-25 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658429, 363874, 56579, '<td valign="top">level your horizion, love the colours</td>', 'level your horizion, love the colours', '2006-07-25 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658430, 366086, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I''m giving this one a 7, as I loved the movement and colors in the sky, and because of the clarity in the water left after the waves went back out.  I loved the clarity and moistness of the stones in the foreground.  I am not so crazy about the forced feeling of the white streaks just behind the stones, or I''d have rated this higher.  Overall, you met the challenge with great creativity and technical merit.</td>', 'Great job!  I''m giving this one a 7, as I loved the movement and colors in the sky, and because of the clarity in the water left after the waves went back out.  I loved the clarity and moistness of the stones in the foreground.  I am not so crazy about the forced feeling of the white streaks just behind the stones, or I''d have rated this higher.  Overall, you met the challenge with great creativity and technical merit.', '2006-07-25 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658435, 366221, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I am giving this shot a 7.  I love the playful light hitting the valley and the cliff face, and love the foreground setting the shot.  I loved the color in the ocean, and the hazy feel of the sky, but the sky lacked a little bit of lackluster, or I''d have rated this higher.  Good job in meeting the challenge, and for making me feel like I want to hang glide from this very spot and float on down to see what lies in the distance.</td>', 'Great job!  I am giving this shot a 7.  I love the playful light hitting the valley and the cliff face, and love the foreground setting the shot.  I loved the color in the ocean, and the hazy feel of the sky, but the sky lacked a little bit of lackluster, or I''d have rated this higher.  Good job in meeting the challenge, and for making me feel like I want to hang glide from this very spot and float on down to see what lies in the distance.', '2006-07-25 13:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658439, 365630, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job, loved the name too!  I''m giving this a 6 for meeting the challenge, and for the beauty of the shot.  It was the name that made this for me though, what a great sense of humor incorporated into your work!</td>', 'Great job, loved the name too!  I''m giving this a 6 for meeting the challenge, and for the beauty of the shot.  It was the name that made this for me though, what a great sense of humor incorporated into your work!', '2006-07-25 13:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658440, 365807, 56579, '<td valign="top">the camera data is really distracting....photo is way too small.....and too dark/busy I can''t see whats going on in such a small space<br/> <br/>I give it a 2</td>', 'the camera data is really distracting....photo is way too small.....and too dark/busy I can''t see whats going on in such a small space I give it a 2', '2006-07-25 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658442, 366000, 56579, '<td valign="top">wish the photo did not have the lens flare</td>', 'wish the photo did not have the lens flare', '2006-07-25 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658443, 365301, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I keep coming back to this shot, voting lower and higher and lower and higher.  I''m giving this shot finally an 8.  I loved the colors in the sky, and the movement of the clouds.  I love the color of the tall reedy grass to the right, and how it focuses one''s vision through the blades and onto the pink part of the sky.  I loved the clarity in the flowers on the left, and the welcoming path to the sea.</td>', 'Great job!  I keep coming back to this shot, voting lower and higher and lower and higher.  I''m giving this shot finally an 8.  I loved the colors in the sky, and the movement of the clouds.  I love the color of the tall reedy grass to the right, and how it focuses one''s vision through the blades and onto the pink part of the sky.  I loved the clarity in the flowers on the left, and the welcoming path to the sea.', '2006-07-25 13:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658447, 366114, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  The reflection of the sky is awesome!  I loved the ripple affect around the child, it looks like he dropped out of the sky in a single movement to create that ripple.  Not very realistic, but creative none-the-less.  I loved the colors in this, and the stillness of the shot.  I loved the clarity of the water in the foreground, and the ability to see the stones through the water if one looks close enough.  I''m giving this an 8, as you meet the challenge with creativity and technical expertise.</td>', 'Great job!  The reflection of the sky is awesome!  I loved the ripple affect around the child, it looks like he dropped out of the sky in a single movement to create that ripple.  Not very realistic, but creative none-the-less.  I loved the colors in this, and the stillness of the shot.  I loved the clarity of the water in the foreground, and the ability to see the stones through the water if one looks close enough.  I''m giving this an 8, as you meet the challenge with creativity and technical expertise.', '2006-07-25 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658449, 365820, 53575, '<td valign="top">I think the image would have been better if there was something ''live'' in it such as an insect or running water.</td>', 'I think the image would have been better if there was something ''live'' in it such as an insect or running water.', '2006-07-25 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658452, 366037, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Breathtaking!  I''m giving this a 7, only because the clouds look a bit forced.  I loved the little island rising from the fog, although the fog doesn''t seem to continue to the left of the driftwood.  Just doesn''t appear even to me.  It''s a great shot though, and I loved the movement of the waves and the white caps.  I''d have to button my jacket, as this one makes me feel as though it''s a damp cool evening about to set in.  Great job in meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Great job!  Breathtaking!  I''m giving this a 7, only because the clouds look a bit forced.  I loved the little island rising from the fog, although the fog doesn''t seem to continue to the left of the driftwood.  Just doesn''t appear even to me.  It''s a great shot though, and I loved the movement of the waves and the white caps.  I''d have to button my jacket, as this one makes me feel as though it''s a damp cool evening about to set in.  Great job in meeting the challenge.', '2006-07-25 13:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658460, 365642, 56579, '<td valign="top">photo is way too small....subject lacks intrest<br/>3</td>', 'photo is way too small....subject lacks intrest3', '2006-07-25 13:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658462, 366095, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I liked the continuity of color between the sky and the ocean, with just a hint of light rays coming through the clouds.  I liked the movement of the ocean, too.  I''m giving this a 6, because you met the challenge well.  I''d have rated it higher but there is something about the closeness to shore of the  larger boat that doesn''t seem realitic, and the size of that boat seems dwarfed un-naturally compared to the smaller boats in the foreground.</td>', 'Great job!  I liked the continuity of color between the sky and the ocean, with just a hint of light rays coming through the clouds.  I liked the movement of the ocean, too.  I''m giving this a 6, because you met the challenge well.  I''d have rated it higher but there is something about the closeness to shore of the  larger boat that doesn''t seem realitic, and the size of that boat seems dwarfed un-naturally compared to the smaller boats in the foreground.', '2006-07-25 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658465, 365509, 56579, '<td valign="top">looks out of focus<br/>3</td>', 'looks out of focus3', '2006-07-25 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658470, 365719, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  This has a great nostalgic feel to it!  I am giving this an 8 because it meets the challenge so well, the technical aspect deserves merit, and because it creates an overall feeling of fun that I like to see in a shot.  I loved the movement of the water, the whitecaps and shadows of the figures all work together very nicely.  Again, great job in meeting the challenge!</td>', 'Great job!  This has a great nostalgic feel to it!  I am giving this an 8 because it meets the challenge so well, the technical aspect deserves merit, and because it creates an overall feeling of fun that I like to see in a shot.  I loved the movement of the water, the whitecaps and shadows of the figures all work together very nicely.  Again, great job in meeting the challenge!', '2006-07-25 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658494, 365339, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love when a shot can just up and carry me away to that place, or make me wish I was there.  I love the true colors of the tropical water.  I loved how you captured the tones of the deep water, and the aqua of the reef-protected beach.  I loved the whitecaps, the shades of the sand where it''s wet, damp and dry.  I especially like the tiny little ''hole'' at the top of the photo that has a little pool of water that is reflecting the deep tones of the sky.  I didn''t care for the waterfall.  I''m giving this shot an 8.</td>', 'Great job!  I love when a shot can just up and carry me away to that place, or make me wish I was there.  I love the true colors of the tropical water.  I loved how you captured the tones of the deep water, and the aqua of the reef-protected beach.  I loved the whitecaps, the shades of the sand where it''s wet, damp and dry.  I especially like the tiny little ''hole'' at the top of the photo that has a little pool of water that is reflecting the deep tones of the sky.  I didn''t care for the waterfall.  I''m giving this shot an 8.', '2006-07-25 13:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658496, 365506, 60187, '<td valign="top">Beautiful white areas on gray/black objects - I''m deeply affected</td>', 'Beautiful white areas on gray/black objects - I''m deeply affected', '2006-07-25 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658503, 366189, 53575, '<td valign="top">Although it most probably could not been helped, I find the blurred foreground distracting.</td>', 'Although it most probably could not been helped, I find the blurred foreground distracting.', '2006-07-25 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658512, 364013, 56579, '<td valign="top">photo too small, background lacks intrest....maybe should have put the subject on the left third and shown more beach....i think having the subject look out to the beach would also be more intresting</td>', 'photo too small, background lacks intrest....maybe should have put the subject on the left third and shown more beach....i think having the subject look out to the beach would also be more intresting', '2006-07-25 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658513, 365944, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love when a shot can take me away to that place or make me wish I was there.  I see a spot in this pic for my beach chair...  Anyway, I loved the colors of the tropical sea, they are very true.   I loved the clarity exhibited in the water left behind from the last wave.  I loved the rolling of the new wave coming in.  I loved the shadows created by the rocks.  I loved the soft feeling of the sand, and the division between the wet and dry sand.  I loved the silhouttes of the palms on top of the rocks as they set against the color of the sky.  The sky has alot of drama and movement, as well as great color.  I''m giving this an 8, not because it''s not wonderful, it''s just not as exciting as some other shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Great job!  I love when a shot can take me away to that place or make me wish I was there.  I see a spot in this pic for my beach chair...  Anyway, I loved the colors of the tropical sea, they are very true.   I loved the clarity exhibited in the water left behind from the last wave.  I loved the rolling of the new wave coming in.  I loved the shadows created by the rocks.  I loved the soft feeling of the sand, and the division between the wet and dry sand.  I loved the silhouttes of the palms on top of the rocks as they set against the color of the sky.  The sky has alot of drama and movement, as well as great color.  I''m giving this an 8, not because it''s not wonderful, it''s just not as exciting as some other shots in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658520, 365492, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  This shot offers alot in the way of color that makes it really special.  I loved the sky, and the perfect horizon.  I loved the feeling that we all better hurry to get out of there before it gets too dark.  I loved the way that you worked the foreground of grasses.  And the subject of the little girl is just cute, nostagic and whimsical all wrapped up in one.  I''ve gone up and down on what I think the score should be, but I am finally giving you a 9 for meeting the challenge, and for the overall beauty and thought put into this shot.  One of the more interesting shots of the challenge.</td>', 'Great job!  This shot offers alot in the way of color that makes it really special.  I loved the sky, and the perfect horizon.  I loved the feeling that we all better hurry to get out of there before it gets too dark.  I loved the way that you worked the foreground of grasses.  And the subject of the little girl is just cute, nostagic and whimsical all wrapped up in one.  I''ve gone up and down on what I think the score should be, but I am finally giving you a 9 for meeting the challenge, and for the overall beauty and thought put into this shot.  One of the more interesting shots of the challenge.', '2006-07-25 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
