(2658545, 365707, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job! This is like looking at a traveler''s postcard.  I loved the colors and the perspective, but especially the color of the water.  I got tired of looking at the typical northern deep blue ocean, and the typical ''caribbean blue'' of alot of the photos in this challenge.  The deep green is a breathtaking change of pace!  I like the clarity of the photo, and the fact that I can see the movement in the sand, even at this distance.  This is one of my favorites, so I''m giving it a 9.  The only thing that looks odd, is the dark spot in the sand between the two cliffs at the bottom of the photo.  Maybe you could have gotten that out of there to allow a continuous feel to that area of the beach.  You should sell this to the Portugal Dept of Tourism... lol</td>', 'Great job! This is like looking at a traveler''s postcard.  I loved the colors and the perspective, but especially the color of the water.  I got tired of looking at the typical northern deep blue ocean, and the typical ''caribbean blue'' of alot of the photos in this challenge.  The deep green is a breathtaking change of pace!  I like the clarity of the photo, and the fact that I can see the movement in the sand, even at this distance.  This is one of my favorites, so I''m giving it a 9.  The only thing that looks odd, is the dark spot in the sand between the two cliffs at the bottom of the photo.  Maybe you could have gotten that out of there to allow a continuous feel to that area of the beach.  You should sell this to the Portugal Dept of Tourism... lol', '2006-07-25 13:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658547, 362624, 62723, '<td valign="top">image seems a little flat, but i like the concept.</td>', 'image seems a little flat, but i like the concept.', '2006-07-25 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
