(2658565, 365198, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  This one takes a minute to figure out what I''m looking at, but that adds to this photo, rather than take away from it.  I loved the clarity of this photo, and the fact that I can see the little bubbles in the foam in the foreground.  I loved the clarity of the sand, and it''s hint at moisture. Good use of color!  I loved the movement of the whitecaps.  I''m giving this an 8, as it met the challenge, deserves technical merit, and for having a bit of whimsy to it.  The real subject of this photo is only hinted at, but that is what makes it so interesting.</td>', 'Great job!  This one takes a minute to figure out what I''m looking at, but that adds to this photo, rather than take away from it.  I loved the clarity of this photo, and the fact that I can see the little bubbles in the foam in the foreground.  I loved the clarity of the sand, and it''s hint at moisture. Good use of color!  I loved the movement of the whitecaps.  I''m giving this an 8, as it met the challenge, deserves technical merit, and for having a bit of whimsy to it.  The real subject of this photo is only hinted at, but that is what makes it so interesting.', '2006-07-25 13:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
