(2658576, 365883, 62723, '<td valign="top">I''d like to learn a little more about this photo..what if anything was done to it in processing. The clouds and emerald water are impressive. Well done in my opinion.</td>', 'I''d like to learn a little more about this photo..what if anything was done to it in processing. The clouds and emerald water are impressive. Well done in my opinion.', '2006-07-25 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
