(2658581, 366067, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I loved the tonal aspect to this whole photograph, with the greys being predominant in the foreground and background, allowing the bird to blend in and stand out at the same time.  The clarity in the bird is awesome.  I''m not giving this as high as I''d like to because this could equally be on a city street as a beach, so in my opinion, it does not clearly meet the challenge, although I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt.  I don''t think that meeting the theme of the challenge should be left to guesswork, there should be some element in the photo to at least hint of the theme, and this one doesn''t.  Other than that, I''m giving it a 7 because it is still a nice shot!</td>', 'Great job!  I loved the tonal aspect to this whole photograph, with the greys being predominant in the foreground and background, allowing the bird to blend in and stand out at the same time.  The clarity in the bird is awesome.  I''m not giving this as high as I''d like to because this could equally be on a city street as a beach, so in my opinion, it does not clearly meet the challenge, although I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt.  I don''t think that meeting the theme of the challenge should be left to guesswork, there should be some element in the photo to at least hint of the theme, and this one doesn''t.  Other than that, I''m giving it a 7 because it is still a nice shot!', '2006-07-25 13:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658584, 365830, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  At first, the subtle colors in this gives the impression that there isn''t much to look at besides the trees.  After looking a bit longer, the hazy mountains in the background, the light bouncing off of the pits in the sand, and the darkened ''kicked up'' sand in the foreground make it very interesting.  I also love the way that the light plays in streaks on the saned.   The only thing that is distracting is the carts or stalls, whatever they are, off to the left of the picture.  I think had you cropped it so they weren''t there, the photo would have been equally as nice.  Above average score, I''m giving this an 8 because it meets the challenge perfectly, not leaving me to have to guess what the theme is, and because of all of the interesting things happening in this pic.  I''d give it a 9, except for that stuff on the left of the pic.</td>', 'Great job!  At first, the subtle colors in this gives the impression that there isn''t much to look at besides the trees.  After looking a bit longer, the hazy mountains in the background, the light bouncing off of the pits in the sand, and the darkened ''kicked up'' sand in the foreground make it very interesting.  I also love the way that the light plays in streaks on the saned.   The only thing that is distracting is the carts or stalls, whatever they are, off to the left of the picture.  I think had you cropped it so they weren''t there, the photo would have been equally as nice.  Above average score, I''m giving this an 8 because it meets the challenge perfectly, not leaving me to have to guess what the theme is, and because of all of the interesting things happening in this pic.  I''d give it a 9, except for that stuff on the left of the pic.', '2006-07-25 13:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658591, 366001, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love the continuity of color between the ocean and the sand, and how the brightness of the apple sets itself apart, making it a true focal point.  Also loved how you captured the reflection of the apple, and the fact that there wetness in the foreground.  I loved the bubbles in the water as well.  I''m giving this a 7 for meeting the challenge theme so well, and for the technical merit that this deserves.  I''d score it higher, but there were just so many photos that had alot more going on in the way of interesting subjects.</td>', 'Great job!  I love the continuity of color between the ocean and the sand, and how the brightness of the apple sets itself apart, making it a true focal point.  Also loved how you captured the reflection of the apple, and the fact that there wetness in the foreground.  I loved the bubbles in the water as well.  I''m giving this a 7 for meeting the challenge theme so well, and for the technical merit that this deserves.  I''d score it higher, but there were just so many photos that had alot more going on in the way of interesting subjects.', '2006-07-25 13:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658597, 364994, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  The colors in this are just breath-taking!  The feel of the fog at night is extraordinary.  It is interesting from corner to corner to corner.  I''m giving this an 8 because it meets the challenge with technical precision and artfulness.</td>', 'Great job!  The colors in this are just breath-taking!  The feel of the fog at night is extraordinary.  It is interesting from corner to corner to corner.  I''m giving this an 8 because it meets the challenge with technical precision and artfulness.', '2006-07-25 13:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658602, 364024, 22970, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!</td>', 'LOL!!!', '2006-07-25 13:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658611, 365567, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but feels too simple. Also cropping could be improved... cutted of at left and lot of space at right. Maybe even might look good in b&amp;w, good contrast with white dress.</td>', 'Nice photo but feels too simple. Also cropping could be improved... cutted of at left and lot of space at right. Maybe even might look good in b&w, good contrast with white dress.', '2006-07-25 13:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658614, 364538, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I found the rocks to be a little boring after looking at them for very long.  It''s still a gorgeous shot, I can feel the storm moving in from the color of the sky and movement of the clouds, and color of the ocean.  I really liked the pool of water in the foreground, the color of it, and the small gull sitting on the rock.  Just not one of my favorites in this challenge, and I gave you a bit of a reduction in regard to meeting the challenge, because when I think of beach, I think of sand, not simply any shoreline.  Many people in this challenge just presented water or shoreline, and to me, that does not a beach make.  I''d have given this a 7 or an 8 for technical merit and overall beauty, but decided on a 6 for the reasons above.</td>', 'Great job!  I found the rocks to be a little boring after looking at them for very long.  It''s still a gorgeous shot, I can feel the storm moving in from the color of the sky and movement of the clouds, and color of the ocean.  I really liked the pool of water in the foreground, the color of it, and the small gull sitting on the rock.  Just not one of my favorites in this challenge, and I gave you a bit of a reduction in regard to meeting the challenge, because when I think of beach, I think of sand, not simply any shoreline.  Many people in this challenge just presented water or shoreline, and to me, that does not a beach make.  I''d have given this a 7 or an 8 for technical merit and overall beauty, but decided on a 6 for the reasons above.', '2006-07-25 13:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658621, 366006, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I liked this photo, you did a good job of creating the feeling of moisture all around - the sky looks like it''s about to rain, or just finished raining.  The color of the ocean shows some storminess.  The foreground seems as though it had remants of a storm surge, or remants of a stormy sea crashing onto it.  I''m giving you a 6 for meeting the challenge and technical merit.</td>', 'Great job!  I liked this photo, you did a good job of creating the feeling of moisture all around - the sky looks like it''s about to rain, or just finished raining.  The color of the ocean shows some storminess.  The foreground seems as though it had remants of a storm surge, or remants of a stormy sea crashing onto it.  I''m giving you a 6 for meeting the challenge and technical merit.', '2006-07-25 13:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658625, 365285, 53575, '<td valign="top">I think the ''rule of thirds'' would have done wonders for this image.</td>', 'I think the ''rule of thirds'' would have done wonders for this image.', '2006-07-25 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658630, 364633, 27524, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and nice feeling of streeming water.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and nice feeling of streeming water.', '2006-07-25 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658632, 363265, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Very nice photo, although it''s something I feel I''ve seen a million and one times.  For what it is though, you did a great job of creating a sense of peace and tranquility, and the use of color is wonderful!  It''s hard to tell where the ''beach'' part comes in, as I feel strongly that a water or shoreline pic does not always signify beach.  But since it''s dark out in this photo, and it''s hard to tell, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, and score you a 7 for meeting the challenge,  and for technical merit.  What knocked you, in my eyes, was lack of originality in comparison with many of the other entries.</td>', 'Great job!  Very nice photo, although it''s something I feel I''ve seen a million and one times.  For what it is though, you did a great job of creating a sense of peace and tranquility, and the use of color is wonderful!  It''s hard to tell where the ''beach'' part comes in, as I feel strongly that a water or shoreline pic does not always signify beach.  But since it''s dark out in this photo, and it''s hard to tell, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, and score you a 7 for meeting the challenge,  and for technical merit.  What knocked you, in my eyes, was lack of originality in comparison with many of the other entries.', '2006-07-25 13:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658633, 365537, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m allergic to moss.  JK.  ;^)</td>', 'I''m allergic to moss.  JK.  ;^)', '2006-07-25 13:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658639, 365939, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very nice compozition and good lights but colors getting bit unnatural.</td>', 'Very nice compozition and good lights but colors getting bit unnatural.', '2006-07-25 13:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658642, 366203, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Have an extra chair?  I went back and forth on how I wanted to score this one.  Although it''s pretty straight forward, not alot of fancy techniques showing through this one, I loved the clarity in it, the foreground has great use of color and technical merit.  The distant part of the photo has great use of color.  I originally was only giving this a 6 because it didn''t compare with some of the ''fancier'' shots out there in this challenge, but I''m raising my score, giving it a final 9 because there is something to be said for being straightforward, being simple, and meeting the challenge PERFECTLY.  What some people failed to realize in this challenge, is that a water pic or a shoreline pic does not always make a beach theme.  Your photo truly does that, in it''s most simple and whimsical form.</td>', 'Great job!  Have an extra chair?  I went back and forth on how I wanted to score this one.  Although it''s pretty straight forward, not alot of fancy techniques showing through this one, I loved the clarity in it, the foreground has great use of color and technical merit.  The distant part of the photo has great use of color.  I originally was only giving this a 6 because it didn''t compare with some of the ''fancier'' shots out there in this challenge, but I''m raising my score, giving it a final 9 because there is something to be said for being straightforward, being simple, and meeting the challenge PERFECTLY.  What some people failed to realize in this challenge, is that a water pic or a shoreline pic does not always make a beach theme.  Your photo truly does that, in it''s most simple and whimsical form.', '2006-07-25 13:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658644, 365684, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love the hint of patriotism in this photo.  This also has a bit of whimsy to it, which I love.  I love the deep colors and shadows, but just a tad dark in my opinion.  Above average, giving this a final 6 for meeting the challenge so well.</td>', 'Great job!  I love the hint of patriotism in this photo.  This also has a bit of whimsy to it, which I love.  I love the deep colors and shadows, but just a tad dark in my opinion.  Above average, giving this a final 6 for meeting the challenge so well.', '2006-07-25 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658649, 366195, 27524, '<td valign="top">Simple, light and nice photo but too much unbalanced empty space. Also compozition cutting photo on halfs by horizont moustly are not recomended.</td>', 'Simple, light and nice photo but too much unbalanced empty space. Also compozition cutting photo on halfs by horizont moustly are not recomended.', '2006-07-25 13:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658653, 365710, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I like this shot, the water is soft, yet flows.  I can sense the movement of the waves, although it''s not overpowering and moves quietly.  I love the stones in the foreground, and who doesn''t love a cute little girl pic?  I''m giving this a final 7 in this challenge, for meeting the challenge perfectly.  ''Things you find on the beach''.  Well, this little girl seems to be doing some ''finding'', and has her enthralled.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Great job!  I like this shot, the water is soft, yet flows.  I can sense the movement of the waves, although it''s not overpowering and moves quietly.  I love the stones in the foreground, and who doesn''t love a cute little girl pic?  I''m giving this a final 7 in this challenge, for meeting the challenge perfectly.  ''Things you find on the beach''.  Well, this little girl seems to be doing some ''finding'', and has her enthralled.  Very nicely done.', '2006-07-25 13:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
