(2658664, 364159, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job! I can feel the powdery sand between my toes!  I liked the perspective in this shot, it''s as though the camera was strapped to a foot walking this path.  I loved the feel of the previous person''s footsteps cut out in the sand, the shadows of the blades of the grass.  The colors all throughout this photo are nicely done.  I am giving this a 7 because it perfectly meets the challenge.  So many people in this challenge have not effectively met the theme, as in my opinion, water and shoreline does not always equal ''beach''.  Yours is true to the theme, is interesting, and deserves technical merit.  Way to go!</td>', 'Great job! I can feel the powdery sand between my toes!  I liked the perspective in this shot, it''s as though the camera was strapped to a foot walking this path.  I loved the feel of the previous person''s footsteps cut out in the sand, the shadows of the blades of the grass.  The colors all throughout this photo are nicely done.  I am giving this a 7 because it perfectly meets the challenge.  So many people in this challenge have not effectively met the theme, as in my opinion, water and shoreline does not always equal ''beach''.  Yours is true to the theme, is interesting, and deserves technical merit.  Way to go!', '2006-07-25 14:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658670, 365507, 52713, '<td valign="top">framing is distracting, nice image though</td>', 'framing is distracting, nice image though', '2006-07-25 14:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658677, 364447, 52713, '<td valign="top">I like the blown out highlights. It really works for htis image. One of my favorite so far.</td>', 'I like the blown out highlights. It really works for htis image. One of my favorite so far.', '2006-07-25 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658678, 365889, 52713, '<td valign="top">good tone and texture captured.</td>', 'good tone and texture captured.', '2006-07-25 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658682, 365394, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I see a bit of graininess in the sky and water, and around the edge of the shell.  Although this is a very nicely executed shot, and the colors are extraordinary, I''m knocking it lower than I wanted to because of the artifacting.  You did meet the challenge perfectly however, as some people seem to think that because they have a water or shoreline pic, that it equates to a beach theme.  In my eyes, they do not.  However, yours is truly meeting the theme, which I appreciate the most.</td>', 'Great job!  I see a bit of graininess in the sky and water, and around the edge of the shell.  Although this is a very nicely executed shot, and the colors are extraordinary, I''m knocking it lower than I wanted to because of the artifacting.  You did meet the challenge perfectly however, as some people seem to think that because they have a water or shoreline pic, that it equates to a beach theme.  In my eyes, they do not.  However, yours is truly meeting the theme, which I appreciate the most.', '2006-07-25 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
