(2658727, 364655, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I loved the colors and silhoutte in this shot, and the overall feel of father/son relationships that you tried to create in this shot.  That type of shot has a very traditional and conservative feel to them.  So with that being said, I have to say that the man''s HAIR (and beard) in this shot just feels WAAAAYYYY out of place in regard to traditional and conservative.  It would have worked better in a skateboarding or surfing pic.  Good job in meeting the challenge 100% though, leaving no room to have to figure it out.</td>', 'Great job!  I loved the colors and silhoutte in this shot, and the overall feel of father/son relationships that you tried to create in this shot.  That type of shot has a very traditional and conservative feel to them.  So with that being said, I have to say that the man''s HAIR (and beard) in this shot just feels WAAAAYYYY out of place in regard to traditional and conservative.  It would have worked better in a skateboarding or surfing pic.  Good job in meeting the challenge 100% though, leaving no room to have to figure it out.', '2006-07-25 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
