(2659112, 363713, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job! A very pretty photo, with great technical merit, great perspective and use of color.  I love the various levels descending down to the water.  Each is interesting in it''s own regard.  The movement of the water around the rocks is also nice.  However, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  And meeting the challenge, to me, is the first and most important thing, if that isn''t done, then anything else is unimportant.  Doesn''t mean it''s not a beautiful and creative shot, because in this case, it absolutely is!  I do love it!  I went back and forth on how to score your pic, but I do vote low for those that I don''t think meet the challenge, so to be consistant, I am voting this lower than I want for the reasons stated above.</td>', 'Great job! A very pretty photo, with great technical merit, great perspective and use of color.  I love the various levels descending down to the water.  Each is interesting in it''s own regard.  The movement of the water around the rocks is also nice.  However, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  And meeting the challenge, to me, is the first and most important thing, if that isn''t done, then anything else is unimportant.  Doesn''t mean it''s not a beautiful and creative shot, because in this case, it absolutely is!  I do love it!  I went back and forth on how to score your pic, but I do vote low for those that I don''t think meet the challenge, so to be consistant, I am voting this lower than I want for the reasons stated above.', '2006-07-25 16:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659115, 365440, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I like the consistant tone of the sky and water/sand in this photo, only broken up by the pier with lights.  The reflection is stunning, and the remnants of the ripples in the sand made by earlier waves is gorgeous!  I''m raising the original score that I gave you, from a 4 to a 6, as it''s above average, just based on the interest of the foreground alone.  Nice job staying on theme.</td>', 'Great job!  I like the consistant tone of the sky and water/sand in this photo, only broken up by the pier with lights.  The reflection is stunning, and the remnants of the ripples in the sand made by earlier waves is gorgeous!  I''m raising the original score that I gave you, from a 4 to a 6, as it''s above average, just based on the interest of the foreground alone.  Nice job staying on theme.', '2006-07-25 16:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659118, 365965, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  The color in the sky is very nice, and the city rising from the haze is subtle but pretty.  Unfortunately, there isn''t alot else to make this photo interesting.  Raising the original score that I gave you from a 4 to a 5.</td>', 'Great job!  The color in the sky is very nice, and the city rising from the haze is subtle but pretty.  Unfortunately, there isn''t alot else to make this photo interesting.  Raising the original score that I gave you from a 4 to a 5.', '2006-07-25 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659120, 366083, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Nice colors in the water.  I liked the movement of the waves as they break too.  Unfortunately, the sky seems to be a bit noisy.  Other than that, it looks like a Corona commercial.  Very nice job keeping to the them of the challenge, which has been a bit of a challenge in and of it''self this go around.  Raising my original score from a 4 to a 5.</td>', 'Great job!  Nice colors in the water.  I liked the movement of the waves as they break too.  Unfortunately, the sky seems to be a bit noisy.  Other than that, it looks like a Corona commercial.  Very nice job keeping to the them of the challenge, which has been a bit of a challenge in and of it''self this go around.  Raising my original score from a 4 to a 5.', '2006-07-25 16:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659123, 364605, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A very lively and interesting black and white photo, and emits a feeling of fun and nostalgia.  I love the movement showing in the water, and your ability to capture the fun of the moment.  Raising my score from a 4 to a 5, good job in meeting the challenge, and demonstrating the theme of that challenge in this photo.</td>', 'Great job!  A very lively and interesting black and white photo, and emits a feeling of fun and nostalgia.  I love the movement showing in the water, and your ability to capture the fun of the moment.  Raising my score from a 4 to a 5, good job in meeting the challenge, and demonstrating the theme of that challenge in this photo.', '2006-07-25 16:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659127, 365580, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job! This is a gorgeous shot.  The colors are out of this world, as is the setting.  The sky is gorgeous, with just a hint of over-processing in the lower right and left portion of the clouds.  The reflection off the water is gorgeous too, as is the movement in the water itself.  Nice silhouttes.  <br/> <br/>However, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  And meeting the challenge, to me, is the first and most important thing, if that isn''t done, then anything else is unimportant.  Doesn''t mean it''s not a beautiful and creative shot, because in this case, it absolutely is!  I do love it!  I went back and forth on how to score your pic, but I do vote low for those that I don''t think meet the challenge, so to be consistant, I am voting this lower than I want for the reasons stated above.  Although I did mark it as a favorite, sorry, I couldn''t vote that way.</td>', 'Great job! This is a gorgeous shot.  The colors are out of this world, as is the setting.  The sky is gorgeous, with just a hint of over-processing in the lower right and left portion of the clouds.  The reflection off the water is gorgeous too, as is the movement in the water itself.  Nice silhouttes.   However, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  And meeting the challenge, to me, is the first and most important thing, if that isn''t done, then anything else is unimportant.  Doesn''t mean it''s not a beautiful and creative shot, because in this case, it absolutely is!  I do love it!  I went back and forth on how to score your pic, but I do vote low for those that I don''t think meet the challenge, so to be consistant, I am voting this lower than I want for the reasons stated above.  Although I did mark it as a favorite, sorry, I couldn''t vote that way.', '2006-07-25 16:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659130, 365484, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  This photo, although nice, is just not very interesting.  The wooden boardwalk would have been better alone, without the other roadway looking things.  Maybe you could have taken this from a different angle with better perspective.  I do like the way the wooden planks curve from the bottom corner upward.  Nice job keeping with the challenge''s theme.</td>', 'Great job!  This photo, although nice, is just not very interesting.  The wooden boardwalk would have been better alone, without the other roadway looking things.  Maybe you could have taken this from a different angle with better perspective.  I do like the way the wooden planks curve from the bottom corner upward.  Nice job keeping with the challenge''s theme.', '2006-07-25 16:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659132, 364336, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I really like the use of the chosen color in this one.  I love the silhoutted figure standing above some very strong and solid looking rocks.  It is also a contrast between the unfailing and imperfect.  Nice tones and movement in the sky.  I''m upping the score because originally, I did not see the beach aspect of it, but now I know it''s a jetty or breakwater, and can see the beach.  Going from a 4 to an 8.</td>', 'Great job!  I really like the use of the chosen color in this one.  I love the silhoutted figure standing above some very strong and solid looking rocks.  It is also a contrast between the unfailing and imperfect.  Nice tones and movement in the sky.  I''m upping the score because originally, I did not see the beach aspect of it, but now I know it''s a jetty or breakwater, and can see the beach.  Going from a 4 to an 8.', '2006-07-25 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659136, 365584, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  This is very pretty, although not extremely interesting.  Nice use of light and color and perspective though.  Good job keeping with the theme of the challenge.  Raising my original score from a 4 to a 5, definately is not below average.</td>', 'Great job!  This is very pretty, although not extremely interesting.  Nice use of light and color and perspective though.  Good job keeping with the theme of the challenge.  Raising my original score from a 4 to a 5, definately is not below average.', '2006-07-25 16:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659138, 365968, 62739, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful image!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful image!', '2006-07-25 16:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659139, 365810, 62739, '<td valign="top">Love the fireworks. It adds so much interest!</td>', 'Love the fireworks. It adds so much interest!', '2006-07-25 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659140, 365861, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  The use of color and light is very nice in this shot.  The movement in the boys and the water where they play is also very nice, as they just don''t look ''planted'' there.  Good job keeping with the theme of the challenge.  Raising the original score that I gave you from a 4 to a 6.</td>', 'Great job!  The use of color and light is very nice in this shot.  The movement in the boys and the water where they play is also very nice, as they just don''t look ''planted'' there.  Good job keeping with the theme of the challenge.  Raising the original score that I gave you from a 4 to a 6.', '2006-07-25 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659141, 364410, 62739, '<td valign="top">This is just gorgeous. Great job!</td>', 'This is just gorgeous. Great job!', '2006-07-25 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659144, 364399, 62739, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and contrast. Love this one! A 10!</td>', 'Wonderful colors and contrast. Love this one! A 10!', '2006-07-25 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659145, 364404, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Very nice use of color and perspective.  Not extremely interesting however, although pretty.  Raising original score from a 4 to a 6.</td>', 'Great job!  Very nice use of color and perspective.  Not extremely interesting however, although pretty.  Raising original score from a 4 to a 6.', '2006-07-25 16:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659147, 365889, 62739, '<td valign="top">The water looks like virgin ice. Lovely!</td>', 'The water looks like virgin ice. Lovely!', '2006-07-25 16:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659148, 363561, 62739, '<td valign="top">Love the anchor. Great interest. A 10!</td>', 'Love the anchor. Great interest. A 10!', '2006-07-25 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659149, 366067, 62739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dof on this. Terrific image!</td>', 'Beautiful dof on this. Terrific image!', '2006-07-25 16:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659151, 365067, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  The color in this one is very nice.  I love the subject matter, but I think the girl and the dog are too small to make any real impact in this photo.  I''m raising my original score from a 4 to a 5.</td>', 'Great job!  The color in this one is very nice.  I love the subject matter, but I think the girl and the dog are too small to make any real impact in this photo.  I''m raising my original score from a 4 to a 5.', '2006-07-25 16:17:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2659152, 365715, 62739, '<td valign="top">One of my top choices for a win. Love the white trees. Great job!</td>', 'One of my top choices for a win. Love the white trees. Great job!', '2006-07-25 16:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659154, 364994, 62739, '<td valign="top">The combining of silence and serenity in the forefront with the opposite happening on the bridge is a great combination. A 10!</td>', 'The combining of silence and serenity in the forefront with the opposite happening on the bridge is a great combination. A 10!', '2006-07-25 16:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659155, 365641, 62739, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful. Love the title to. :-D</td>', 'Just wonderful. Love the title to. :-D', '2006-07-25 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659156, 366078, 62739, '<td valign="top">Great black and white image! Good luck!</td>', 'Great black and white image! Good luck!', '2006-07-25 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659162, 365493, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A very clear shot, nice clarity and movement of the water.  Would have been better had she not been so much in the shadow.  Raising my original score from a 4 to a 6.</td>', 'Great job!  A very clear shot, nice clarity and movement of the water.  Would have been better had she not been so much in the shadow.  Raising my original score from a 4 to a 6.', '2006-07-25 16:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659163, 365944, 62739, '<td valign="top">Nice color combinations. Love the huge rock and virgin sand.</td>', 'Nice color combinations. Love the huge rock and virgin sand.', '2006-07-25 16:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659165, 366148, 62739, '<td valign="top">Terrific image. Great job!</td>', 'Terrific image. Great job!', '2006-07-25 16:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659166, 365832, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A nice photo, great movement and mood in the waves as they crash in on shore.  Just not extremely interesting.  Might have been better in color.</td>', 'Great job!  A nice photo, great movement and mood in the waves as they crash in on shore.  Just not extremely interesting.  Might have been better in color.', '2006-07-25 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659167, 366075, 62739, '<td valign="top">I have yet to catch one. Great work!</td>', 'I have yet to catch one. Great work!', '2006-07-25 16:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659169, 365389, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job@  Nice use of deliberate color.  Raising original score from a 4 to a 6.</td>', 'Great job@  Nice use of deliberate color.  Raising original score from a 4 to a 6.', '2006-07-25 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659170, 365230, 62739, '<td valign="top">I missed it this year. Didn''t want to battle the crowds, but I will see it in November I think. Sometime this winter they have another show, and I will be there for that one, but this is terrific!</td>', 'I missed it this year. Didn''t want to battle the crowds, but I will see it in November I think. Sometime this winter they have another show, and I will be there for that one, but this is terrific!', '2006-07-25 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659172, 365957, 62739, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would get a shot of dolphins! Great job!</td>', 'I was hoping someone would get a shot of dolphins! Great job!', '2006-07-25 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659173, 365440, 62739, '<td valign="top">Beatiful work.  Nice reflections and the little surfer. Great job!</td>', 'Beatiful work.  Nice reflections and the little surfer. Great job!', '2006-07-25 16:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659174, 366086, 62739, '<td valign="top">Love the rocks in the foreground. Beautiful image!</td>', 'Love the rocks in the foreground. Beautiful image!', '2006-07-25 16:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659176, 365674, 62739, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous contrasts. Some of my favorite colors here. Great work!</td>', 'Gorgeous contrasts. Some of my favorite colors here. Great work!', '2006-07-25 16:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659177, 364737, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  One of the prettiest clouds that I''ve seen in this challenge, and you did great to capitalize on it.  Colors are intense, and has no flat feel to this photo.  Upping original score from a 4 to a 6.</td>', 'Great job!  One of the prettiest clouds that I''ve seen in this challenge, and you did great to capitalize on it.  Colors are intense, and has no flat feel to this photo.  Upping original score from a 4 to a 6.', '2006-07-25 16:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659179, 364540, 62739, '<td valign="top">Very nice work. I think the large driftwood is a great interesting addition.</td>', 'Very nice work. I think the large driftwood is a great interesting addition.', '2006-07-25 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659181, 363907, 62739, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Great image!</td>', 'Lovely. Great image!', '2006-07-25 16:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659184, 365168, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love the ''violence'' in the water as the dogs play.  Amazing to see the action stopped that way, where I can see them actually kicking up some sand/mud.  The colors are very pretty in this.  I''m not usually into animal pics, but this is one of the better ones that I''ve seen.  Raising original score from a 4 to a 7.</td>', 'Great job!  I love the ''violence'' in the water as the dogs play.  Amazing to see the action stopped that way, where I can see them actually kicking up some sand/mud.  The colors are very pretty in this.  I''m not usually into animal pics, but this is one of the better ones that I''ve seen.  Raising original score from a 4 to a 7.', '2006-07-25 16:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659185, 364880, 62739, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus on this image. I love his expression. Very nice work!</td>', 'Wonderful focus on this image. I love his expression. Very nice work!', '2006-07-25 16:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659186, 366172, 62739, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2006-07-25 16:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659187, 366088, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Love the way you were able to capture the clarity of teh water, although otehr than that, no real interest in this shot.</td>', 'Great job!  Love the way you were able to capture the clarity of teh water, although otehr than that, no real interest in this shot.', '2006-07-25 16:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659188, 365707, 62739, '<td valign="top">Nice high view.  It is nice there were people there to give the perspective. Great job!</td>', 'Nice high view.  It is nice there were people there to give the perspective. Great job!', '2006-07-25 16:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659189, 363050, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I like the little pools of water that are not very obvious in this photo.  The water is just being hinted at, which adds to the interest here.  Upping this score from a 4 to a 6.</td>', 'Great job!  I like the little pools of water that are not very obvious in this photo.  The water is just being hinted at, which adds to the interest here.  Upping this score from a 4 to a 6.', '2006-07-25 16:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659190, 364914, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A very nice shot, nice use of light and color.  Upping original score from a 4 to a 5.</td>', 'Great job!  A very nice shot, nice use of light and color.  Upping original score from a 4 to a 5.', '2006-07-25 16:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659194, 365174, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I''m usually not big into wildlife shots, but this one is very nice.  Hope you had a tele lens and took this from a distance.  Anyway, good capture of life in the wild. Raising original score from a 4 to a 6.  Originally, I didn''t classify this as a beach photo, I thought it was a roadway.  But it appears to be a beach afterall.</td>', 'Great job!  I''m usually not big into wildlife shots, but this one is very nice.  Hope you had a tele lens and took this from a distance.  Anyway, good capture of life in the wild. Raising original score from a 4 to a 6.  Originally, I didn''t classify this as a beach photo, I thought it was a roadway.  But it appears to be a beach afterall.', '2006-07-25 16:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659196, 365567, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A nice title to add to a nice photo.  Although the lighting seems to be a bit flat in this one, and the colors washed out.  Even still, I am upping the score from a 4 to a 5.</td>', 'Great job!  A nice title to add to a nice photo.  Although the lighting seems to be a bit flat in this one, and the colors washed out.  Even still, I am upping the score from a 4 to a 5.', '2006-07-25 16:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659202, 364527, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A pretty silhoutte shot, with absolutely STUNNING colors.  The sky is serene, and the water has movement.   However, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  Since this is in black, I will imagine that it''s taken on a ''beach'', and score giving you the benefit of the doubt.  Raising original score from a 4 to an 8, mostly because the color is extraordinary.</td>', 'Great job!  A pretty silhoutte shot, with absolutely STUNNING colors.  The sky is serene, and the water has movement.   However, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  Since this is in black, I will imagine that it''s taken on a ''beach'', and score giving you the benefit of the doubt.  Raising original score from a 4 to an 8, mostly because the color is extraordinary.', '2006-07-25 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659203, 362920, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job!  A pretty shot, although corners seem to be a little blackened.  Maybe that is your intent, I don''t know.  Pretty colors, but seems to be a little lackluster.  In addition, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  And meeting the challenge, to me, is the first and most important thing, if that isn''t done, then anything else is unimportant.  Doesn''t mean it''s not a beautiful and creative shot, because in this case, it absolutely is!  I do love it!  I went back and forth on how to score your pic, but I do vote low for those that I don''t think meet the challenge, so to be consistant, I am voting this lower than I want for the reasons stated above.</td>', 'Great job!  A pretty shot, although corners seem to be a little blackened.  Maybe that is your intent, I don''t know.  Pretty colors, but seems to be a little lackluster.  In addition, a water shot, or even a shoreline shot, does not always mean ''beach'' in my opinion.  And meeting the challenge, to me, is the first and most important thing, if that isn''t done, then anything else is unimportant.  Doesn''t mean it''s not a beautiful and creative shot, because in this case, it absolutely is!  I do love it!  I went back and forth on how to score your pic, but I do vote low for those that I don''t think meet the challenge, so to be consistant, I am voting this lower than I want for the reasons stated above.', '2006-07-25 16:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
