(2662094, 363842, 34938, '<td valign="top">Rick, this soooo deserved a better score! Maybe your wife was right about the title...but the clarity and light and the frozen action and expressions...a wonderful shot you should be proud of</td>', 'Rick, this soooo deserved a better score! Maybe your wife was right about the title...but the clarity and light and the frozen action and expressions...a wonderful shot you should be proud of', '2006-07-26 06:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
