(2662256, 365889, 31885, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning, congratulations!</td>', 'Simply stunning, congratulations!', '2006-07-26 07:56:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662258, 365829, 26930, '<td valign="top">I think you should have had a better score for this one. Mybe more DOF would have helped you here.</td>', 'I think you should have had a better score for this one. Mybe more DOF would have helped you here.', '2006-07-26 07:57:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662287, 365493, 10883, '<td valign="top">Seriously, 23 1''s?  This photo does not deserve that.<br/> <br/>The pic above has 2 1''s, 9 2''s and 28 3''s.<br/>The pic below has 2 1''s, 15 2''s and 22 3''s<br/> <br/>You have more 1''s, 2''s and 3''s then either of those... (except for the 2''s on the lower pic)<br/>The anti-nudity crowd sure helped you to a lower score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-26 07:18:01.</i></td>', 'Seriously, 23 1''s?  This photo does not deserve that. The pic above has 2 1''s, 9 2''s and 28 3''s.The pic below has 2 1''s, 15 2''s and 22 3''s You have more 1''s, 2''s and 3''s then either of those... (except for the 2''s on the lower pic)The anti-nudity crowd sure helped you to a lower score.', '2006-07-26 08:15:04.000000', '2006-07-26 08:18:01.000000', 0),
(2662296, 366172, 54709, '<td valign="top">HelvXXX tvistar, þristar og fjarkar....hvaða rugl er það?!? <br/>Snilldar mynd að mínu mati, átti skilið að fara mun hærra en þetta. <br/> <br/>Not a ribbon but a great shot anyway.</td>', 'HelvXXX tvistar, þristar og fjarkar....hvaða rugl er það?!? Snilldar mynd að mínu mati, átti skilið að fara mun hærra en þetta.  Not a ribbon but a great shot anyway.', '2006-07-26 08:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662317, 366001, 38732, '<td valign="top">I only voted on about 2/3 of the shots, so I never got to yours. :(<br/> <br/>When I saw the thumbnail, I thought you''d used selective colour, but it just seemed that way.  I really like the contrast of the bright red apple against the grey and white of the rest of the scene; really helps to focus the view on the subject. Very good reflection you captured, which helps with the focus on the subject and brings a little more to the shot as a whole.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I don''t exactly find the subject very interesting, which I think is what may have brought your score down, though I could be wrong.  Technically, I think it''s a great shot, except for the blown highlights on the apple; bright colour and nice composition in general.  With the subject at hand, I probably couldn''t have shot it any better.<br/> <br/>Hehe, noticed that you placed just ahead of Becky :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-26 07:34:37.</i></td>', 'I only voted on about 2/3 of the shots, so I never got to yours. :( When I saw the thumbnail, I thought you''d used selective colour, but it just seemed that way.  I really like the contrast of the bright red apple against the grey and white of the rest of the scene; really helps to focus the view on the subject. Very good reflection you captured, which helps with the focus on the subject and brings a little more to the shot as a whole. Unfortunately, I don''t exactly find the subject very interesting, which I think is what may have brought your score down, though I could be wrong.  Technically, I think it''s a great shot, except for the blown highlights on the apple; bright colour and nice composition in general.  With the subject at hand, I probably couldn''t have shot it any better. Hehe, noticed that you placed just ahead of Becky :)', '2006-07-26 08:32:24.000000', '2006-07-26 08:34:37.000000', 0),
(2662344, 366114, 24454, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo Ragga!   I love the quiet simple feel to this!</td>', 'Amazing photo Ragga!   I love the quiet simple feel to this!', '2006-07-26 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662348, 365889, 24454, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo Bragi!!!!   You works of art never cease to amaze me!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on getting to honors with this one!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Amazing photo Bragi!!!!   You works of art never cease to amaze me! Congratulations on getting to honors with this one! ', '2006-07-26 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662349, 365939, 46782, '<td valign="top">This is better then I I could have hoped for. Finishing with a 7.003 is fantastic. I will be posting a few of the outtakes from this "Boat" series. Some turned iout just as good or better but with a little extra post processing (IE: Removing palm leaves) that I could''nt do in the original submission.<br/> The reason the palm leaves were in (as many pointed out) was due to the fact that I was trying to hide the frighter behind the palm tree - I must have done a good job since nobody mentioned it - if you look close you can see it sticking out on either side of the tree trunk on the horizon line.<br/> <br/>jim</td>', 'This is better then I I could have hoped for. Finishing with a 7.003 is fantastic. I will be posting a few of the outtakes from this "Boat" series. Some turned iout just as good or better but with a little extra post processing (IE: Removing palm leaves) that I could''nt do in the original submission. The reason the palm leaves were in (as many pointed out) was due to the fact that I was trying to hide the frighter behind the palm tree - I must have done a good job since nobody mentioned it - if you look close you can see it sticking out on either side of the tree trunk on the horizon line. jim', '2006-07-26 08:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662353, 365939, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an awesome photo!   Who would have thought a 7.003 could end up in 8th place!!  Tells you what a tough competition this was.  Congratulations on being one of the best in this competitive challenge!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'What an awesome photo!   Who would have thought a 7.003 could end up in 8th place!!  Tells you what a tough competition this was.  Congratulations on being one of the best in this competitive challenge!!! ', '2006-07-26 08:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662354, 365810, 46782, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - all of my top picks finished int he top 10! Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful - all of my top picks finished int he top 10! Congrats on the ribbon.', '2006-07-26 08:48:57.000000', NULL, 0);
