(2662361, 363561, 46782, '<td valign="top">Thios was my #1 pick - I thought it was aa shoe in for first place - great image and beautiful colors.</td>', 'Thios was my #1 pick - I thought it was aa shoe in for first place - great image and beautiful colors.', '2006-07-26 08:50:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662367, 366208, 39850, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the good comments.  Apologies about the sensor dust/eyesore.  Here is an edited version:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=370002" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/370002.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/370002.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/370002.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>And a couple of out-takes:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=369992" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/369992.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/369992.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/369992.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=369994" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/369994.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/369994.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/369994.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-28 18:41:39.</i></td>', 'Thank you for all the good comments.  Apologies about the sensor dust/eyesore.  Here is an edited version:  And a couple of out-takes: ', '2006-07-26 08:53:20.000000', '2006-07-28 19:41:39.000000', 0),
(2662368, 365335, 38127, '<td valign="top">you just hit all the right elements for me...<br/>I love a sunset.. add a surfer and board with those vibrant colours and to top it off.. a silhouette... Wow ;) nice photo :)</td>', 'you just hit all the right elements for me...I love a sunset.. add a surfer and board with those vibrant colours and to top it off.. a silhouette... Wow ;) nice photo :)', '2006-07-26 08:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662560, 365810, 40797, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your well deserved first place ribbon! Simply Beautiful!</td>', 'Congratulations on your well deserved first place ribbon! Simply Beautiful!', '2006-07-26 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662578, 364195, 57839, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much for the comments and votes.</td>', 'Thank you all very much for the comments and votes.', '2006-07-26 09:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662623, 365389, 43774, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your score! When I saw this in the challenge I was thinking it looked like your type of photo. I love your processing, the colours are great.</td>', 'Congrats on your score! When I saw this in the challenge I was thinking it looked like your type of photo. I love your processing, the colours are great.', '2006-07-26 09:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662753, 365919, 34938, '<td valign="top">Hi Linda...this is the comment you made for my shot which was actually taken at the beach and has water for all of its background:<br/> <br/><i>Great job! I loved the tonal aspect to this whole photograph, with the greys being predominant in the foreground and background, allowing the bird to blend in and stand out at the same time. The clarity in the bird is awesome. I''m not giving this as high as I''d like to because this could equally be on a city street as a beach, so in my opinion, it does not clearly meet the challenge, although I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt. I don''t think that meeting the theme of the challenge should be left to guesswork, there should be some element in the photo to at least hint of the theme, and this one doesn''t. Other than that, I''m giving it a 7 because it is still a nice shot!</i> <br/> <br/>I am now looking at your shot and wonder how you come up with your comments. I think that there''s going to be an avalanche of pm''s coming your way from some disgruntled dpcers who may not agree with your comments or your ''hidden during voting'' ''great shot'' comments...<br/> <br/>I appreciate that you gave me the benefit of the doubt and a 7 in any case</td>', 'Hi Linda...this is the comment you made for my shot which was actually taken at the beach and has water for all of its background: Great job! I loved the tonal aspect to this whole photograph, with the greys being predominant in the foreground and background, allowing the bird to blend in and stand out at the same time. The clarity in the bird is awesome. I''m not giving this as high as I''d like to because this could equally be on a city street as a beach, so in my opinion, it does not clearly meet the challenge, although I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt. I don''t think that meeting the theme of the challenge should be left to guesswork, there should be some element in the photo to at least hint of the theme, and this one doesn''t. Other than that, I''m giving it a 7 because it is still a nice shot!  I am now looking at your shot and wonder how you come up with your comments. I think that there''s going to be an avalanche of pm''s coming your way from some disgruntled dpcers who may not agree with your comments or your ''hidden during voting'' ''great shot'' comments... I appreciate that you gave me the benefit of the doubt and a 7 in any case', '2006-07-26 10:24:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662795, 365829, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot; however, I gave it a 5.  The water is almost 50% of the image and mostly out of focus.  As negative space, it really doesn''t help the image.  If might want to try a square crop or even a horizontal crop to minimize the water as much as possible without removing the beach/water connection.</td>', 'I like this image a lot; however, I gave it a 5.  The water is almost 50% of the image and mostly out of focus.  As negative space, it really doesn''t help the image.  If might want to try a square crop or even a horizontal crop to minimize the water as much as possible without removing the beach/water connection.', '2006-07-26 10:34:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662797, 365700, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice score... glad it was appreciated.</td>', 'Nice score... glad it was appreciated.', '2006-07-26 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662799, 365939, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  Well-deserved too.</td>', 'Congratulations.  Well-deserved too.', '2006-07-26 10:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662801, 365810, 49652, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2006-07-26 10:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662804, 366086, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky.  One of my favourites.  Glad to see you in the top ten.</td>', 'Lovely sky.  One of my favourites.  Glad to see you in the top ten.', '2006-07-26 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662806, 364633, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely work and glad to see you score so highly.</td>', 'Lovely work and glad to see you score so highly.', '2006-07-26 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662809, 363561, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a high placing.  Well-deserved.</td>', 'Congrats on a high placing.  Well-deserved.', '2006-07-26 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662810, 366095, 49652, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  I love the muted colors.</td>', 'Terrific shot!  I love the muted colors.', '2006-07-26 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662813, 366133, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is well done and I gave it a 6.  I took your word that it was near a place with surf, as it is hard to connect this image as being near water, let alone a beach scene.  Your overall score probably suffered because of that.</td>', 'This image is well done and I gave it a 6.  I took your word that it was near a place with surf, as it is hard to connect this image as being near water, let alone a beach scene.  Your overall score probably suffered because of that.', '2006-07-26 10:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662825, 365935, 49326, '<td valign="top">Ég er með gott ráð: hvað ef þú hættir að hugsa um þessa mynd og tekur bara aftur svona mynd seinna. Þá áttu að hafa konu  í staðinn fyrir kall og lætur hana hlaupa í átt til þín. Svo verðuru að gera aðeins mýkri lýsingu. Þá áttu örugglega eftir að fá slatta af 10 :)</td>', 'Ég er með gott ráð: hvað ef þú hættir að hugsa um þessa mynd og tekur bara aftur svona mynd seinna. Þá áttu að hafa konu  í staðinn fyrir kall og lætur hana hlaupa í átt til þín. Svo verðuru að gera aðeins mýkri lýsingu. Þá áttu örugglega eftir að fá slatta af 10 :)', '2006-07-26 10:40:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662849, 366067, 40797, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a great capture! This is going straight into my favorite folder!</td>', 'Congratulations on a great capture! This is going straight into my favorite folder!', '2006-07-26 10:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662854, 365935, 26930, '<td valign="top">Takk drengir, þessi mynd skiptir mig nú ekki miklu máli en það er bara það sem pyrrar mig að fólk verður alltaf að hafa eithvað perfect pípúl hérna inni.<br/> <br/>Fíla það ekki</td>', 'Takk drengir, þessi mynd skiptir mig nú ekki miklu máli en það er bara það sem pyrrar mig að fólk verður alltaf að hafa eithvað perfect pípúl hérna inni. Fíla það ekki', '2006-07-26 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662861, 366067, 37961, '<td valign="top">Super sharp dof and focus. Wonderful bird shot.</td>', 'Super sharp dof and focus. Wonderful bird shot.', '2006-07-26 10:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662869, 365935, 37961, '<td valign="top">I love it!! Great amusement and subject matter.</td>', 'I love it!! Great amusement and subject matter.', '2006-07-26 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662898, 365804, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image really does tell a story and the exposure and contrast on the boy is spot on.  I gave it a 7 and would have scored this a couple of points higher if the wave had more detail.  I think you got everything you could have out of this for the tough lighting conditions you had.</td>', 'This image really does tell a story and the exposure and contrast on the boy is spot on.  I gave it a 7 and would have scored this a couple of points higher if the wave had more detail.  I think you got everything you could have out of this for the tough lighting conditions you had.', '2006-07-26 10:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662922, 365269, 61679, '<td valign="top">This shot is under-rated.  Those that gave a low score because it wasn''t a beach scene didn''t read the challenge close enough.  The composition, dof, and colors are wonderful and I gave this a 7.  I would have scored it higher but it looks a little over sharpened imho.</td>', 'This shot is under-rated.  Those that gave a low score because it wasn''t a beach scene didn''t read the challenge close enough.  The composition, dof, and colors are wonderful and I gave this a 7.  I would have scored it higher but it looks a little over sharpened imho.', '2006-07-26 10:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662938, 365259, 60332, '<td valign="top">Added the vignetting in Adobe Camera Raw at the last minute, thought it was kind of cool.  Not a good idea, should have taken a closer look at the rules before I did that.  But thank you for your comments and votes before disqualification.</td>', 'Added the vignetting in Adobe Camera Raw at the last minute, thought it was kind of cool.  Not a good idea, should have taken a closer look at the rules before I did that.  But thank you for your comments and votes before disqualification.', '2006-07-26 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662994, 365700, 2240, '<td valign="top">Rikki what a eye for a shot you have. This is a beauty. Congrats on 7th place.</td>', 'Rikki what a eye for a shot you have. This is a beauty. Congrats on 7th place.', '2006-07-26 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662998, 365804, 61559, '<td valign="top">This surfer shot is GREAT. The composition is spot on, the surfer really jumps out of the picture the way a subject should and it has a very nice feel as well. NICE!</td>', 'This surfer shot is GREAT. The composition is spot on, the surfer really jumps out of the picture the way a subject should and it has a very nice feel as well. NICE!', '2006-07-26 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663000, 365269, 58999, '<td valign="top">Thanks every one for wonderful comments. Only thing I don''t agree with is the *not meeting the challenge* thoughts. There are many comments about this being too sharp. I did USM with radius=1, strength = 100% and threshold=10 on an image of size 4??X620. I really need to learn how to "sharpen/not to sharpen" my images.</td>', 'Thanks every one for wonderful comments. Only thing I don''t agree with is the *not meeting the challenge* thoughts. There are many comments about this being too sharp. I did USM with radius=1, strength = 100% and threshold=10 on an image of size 4??X620. I really need to learn how to "sharpen/not to sharpen" my images.', '2006-07-26 11:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663034, 364399, 2240, '<td valign="top">Congrats Bryan. Great job.</td>', 'Congrats Bryan. Great job.', '2006-07-26 11:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663057, 365700, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rikki. One of my favs of the challenge.  A true work of art.  I may have to put this in my favorites folder. ;~D</td>', 'Congrats Rikki. One of my favs of the challenge.  A true work of art.  I may have to put this in my favorites folder. ;~D', '2006-07-26 11:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663114, 365269, 40484, '<td valign="top">I think this shot meets the challenge very well. For the challenge, I know you couldn''t spot edit the bark, but now you might want to try darkening some of the brighter highlights on the log to put more emphasis on the bird. For sharpening, you might want to try having the threshold at 0 when doing your unsharp mask. I like your overall composition and the colours are great.</td>', 'I think this shot meets the challenge very well. For the challenge, I know you couldn''t spot edit the bark, but now you might want to try darkening some of the brighter highlights on the log to put more emphasis on the bird. For sharpening, you might want to try having the threshold at 0 when doing your unsharp mask. I like your overall composition and the colours are great.', '2006-07-26 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663147, 365269, 58999, '<td valign="top">Thanks Ricky and Tim. Ricky, I will try your suggestion on the USM. I did use Shadow/Highlights to reduce the  highlights in this image. But the log was just too bright. Luckily, I did not over-expose this image.</td>', 'Thanks Ricky and Tim. Ricky, I will try your suggestion on the USM. I did use Shadow/Highlights to reduce the  highlights in this image. But the log was just too bright. Luckily, I did not over-expose this image.', '2006-07-26 11:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663163, 364880, 58999, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image. Reminded me of "The chronicles of Narnia" :-). I love his expression. He seems to be making a comment on your camera. I think it perfectly meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice image. Reminded me of "The chronicles of Narnia" :-). I love his expression. He seems to be making a comment on your camera. I think it perfectly meets the challenge.', '2006-07-26 11:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663532, 365749, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice finish on a great photo Maggie!!!</td>', 'Nice finish on a great photo Maggie!!!', '2006-07-26 12:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663586, 363911, 49652, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites from the challenge and I thought it would place much higher. I gave it a 10. Well done.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites from the challenge and I thought it would place much higher. I gave it a 10. Well done.', '2006-07-26 13:00:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2663615, 365889, 28532, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!!!  Congratulations!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!!!  Congratulations!!!!', '2006-07-26 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
