(2665492, 365749, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Good candid/thoughtful moment capture.  Difficult with the whitewash in the background, but perhaps a little more contrast/vivid colors in the wetsuits and boards, may have given this a little extra.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a crop variation at the top too.  Be a good photograph for this ''surfing team'' to have/own.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Good candid/thoughtful moment capture.  Difficult with the whitewash in the background, but perhaps a little more contrast/vivid colors in the wetsuits and boards, may have given this a little extra.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a crop variation at the top too.  Be a good photograph for this ''surfing team'' to have/own.', '2006-07-26 20:58:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2665607, 364293, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>Another new top row entry!  Congrats on that.  This is a very pleasing picture to me on several counts - the colors are soft with the blue not overdone; the composition is very good and very nicely balanced; and the young man is clearly engaged in "the moment", seemingly oblivious to the camera.  Underrated and probably my favorite picture of yours to date.</td>', 'Trading Post comment Another new top row entry!  Congrats on that.  This is a very pleasing picture to me on several counts - the colors are soft with the blue not overdone; the composition is very good and very nicely balanced; and the young man is clearly engaged in "the moment", seemingly oblivious to the camera.  Underrated and probably my favorite picture of yours to date.', '2006-07-26 21:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2665648, 366212, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>You''re on a roll - two new additions to your top row in one week, and good scores on both of them!  This shot is one of the benefits of living in Hawaii, no doubt.  Lovely colors in the sunset and nice positioning to get the rays from the clouds.  I like how you have the horizon very nearly centered, yet the other elements of the picture balance that out nicely.  The use of silhouettes over preserving considerable detail in the people serves this picture very well.  Nice job!</td>', 'Trading Post comment You''re on a roll - two new additions to your top row in one week, and good scores on both of them!  This shot is one of the benefits of living in Hawaii, no doubt.  Lovely colors in the sunset and nice positioning to get the rays from the clouds.  I like how you have the horizon very nearly centered, yet the other elements of the picture balance that out nicely.  The use of silhouettes over preserving considerable detail in the people serves this picture very well.  Nice job!', '2006-07-26 21:33:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2665683, 365455, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post commment<br/> <br/>A very intriguing picture.  On first glance, I don''t like the skull there, but after really looking at it for a bit, it does indeed work, althought I think you could have done this more panoramic even at 640.  Have the skull be just a bit less "in your face" - more of a subtle discovery as the picture is explored.  Blues of the sky and the water are perfectly done.  I especially like the single narrow crested wave in the distance.  Well seen, well executed.</td>', 'Trading Post commment A very intriguing picture.  On first glance, I don''t like the skull there, but after really looking at it for a bit, it does indeed work, althought I think you could have done this more panoramic even at 640.  Have the skull be just a bit less "in your face" - more of a subtle discovery as the picture is explored.  Blues of the sky and the water are perfectly done.  I especially like the single narrow crested wave in the distance.  Well seen, well executed.', '2006-07-26 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2665980, 365240, 36382, '<td valign="top">I really liked this picture.  I thought it was a really good take on the challenge.  I can''t believe it didn''t place MUCH higher.  I gave you a 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-26 22:43:08.</i></td>', 'I really liked this picture.  I thought it was a really good take on the challenge.  I can''t believe it didn''t place MUCH higher.  I gave you a 9', '2006-07-26 23:27:02.000000', '2006-07-26 23:43:08.000000', 0),
