(2670085, 364081, 61448, '<td valign="top">So you are saying... this image, the way God created it... was not good enough and you mucked about with a dozen different software editing options and created something that never did, nor ever will exist? So this is not really a photograph... it is graphic art... a representation of what you wish were true, not a true depiction of what was. Congrats on your ribbon....</td>', 'So you are saying... this image, the way God created it... was not good enough and you mucked about with a dozen different software editing options and created something that never did, nor ever will exist? So this is not really a photograph... it is graphic art... a representation of what you wish were true, not a true depiction of what was. Congrats on your ribbon....', '2006-07-28 01:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
