(2670792, 365848, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful, Brian!  The colors are wonderful.  What I really like best is the tree on the left - where it is in relation to the rest of the picture, and the fact that you didn''t include all of it.  It creates both a sense of mystery in a way, and a sense of balance, with the tree on the edge to the left and the water approaching from the right.  The photograph definitely speaks softly of tranquility!</td>', 'This is quite beautiful, Brian!  The colors are wonderful.  What I really like best is the tree on the left - where it is in relation to the rest of the picture, and the fact that you didn''t include all of it.  It creates both a sense of mystery in a way, and a sense of balance, with the tree on the edge to the left and the water approaching from the right.  The photograph definitely speaks softly of tranquility!', '2006-07-28 08:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2670862, 365939, 8367, '<td valign="top">For the challenge, it may have helped to crop tighter on the left to eliminate the palms and it would also offset your subject. It would have the left side ever so slightly cut off but, imho, would improve the composition and you could also slightly straigten the horizon in the process. Congratulations on your high score and placement.<br/>I wish I had a 7!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-28 08:39:59.</i></td>', 'For the challenge, it may have helped to crop tighter on the left to eliminate the palms and it would also offset your subject. It would have the left side ever so slightly cut off but, imho, would improve the composition and you could also slightly straigten the horizon in the process. Congratulations on your high score and placement.I wish I had a 7!', '2006-07-28 09:37:50.000000', '2006-07-28 09:39:59.000000', 0),
