(2671879, 363561, 70, '<td valign="top">Bummer on the DQ. I hope you don''t let this deter you from entering again in the future. You have some stunning images in your flickr portfolio and I''d love to see more work from you. Just make sure you read through the rules (and don''t forget that your entry has to be taken *after* the challenge topic is announced).</td>', 'Bummer on the DQ. I hope you don''t let this deter you from entering again in the future. You have some stunning images in your flickr portfolio and I''d love to see more work from you. Just make sure you read through the rules (and don''t forget that your entry has to be taken *after* the challenge topic is announced).', '2006-07-28 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
