(2673792, 364447, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of where the high contrast conveys feelings similar to what you put in your description.  I didn''t get the full detail you wrote up, but I definitely understood the idea of being alone, with no clear idea what''s out there.<br/> <br/>I wonder whether it''d convey it even more to crop it more to the left, so you see less dock and more emptiness on the left?</td>', 'This is a great example of where the high contrast conveys feelings similar to what you put in your description.  I didn''t get the full detail you wrote up, but I definitely understood the idea of being alone, with no clear idea what''s out there. I wonder whether it''d convey it even more to crop it more to the left, so you see less dock and more emptiness on the left?', '2006-07-29 12:04:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2674624, 365621, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection here.<br/>And Heineken sucks sucks sucks, that''s the message ON the bottle. :)<br/> <br/>Noise Ninja, Noise Ninja.... You so deserve a nice clean dSLR! You see, you are so serious with this hobby, approaching girls behind the bar and all to take great shots of them - not the excuse your wife wants to hear I think :)))-. A nice simple dSLR body and a 50 prime lens could help a lot there. Most will still fire your current flash.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the reflection here.And Heineken sucks sucks sucks, that''s the message ON the bottle. :) Noise Ninja, Noise Ninja.... You so deserve a nice clean dSLR! You see, you are so serious with this hobby, approaching girls behind the bar and all to take great shots of them - not the excuse your wife wants to hear I think :)))-. A nice simple dSLR body and a 50 prime lens could help a lot there. Most will still fire your current flash. ', '2006-07-29 19:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2674683, 365621, 50551, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Azrifel:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the reflection here.<br/>And Heineken sucks sucks sucks, that''s the message ON the bottle. :)<br/> <br/>Noise Ninja, Noise Ninja.... You so deserve a nice clean dSLR! You see, you are so serious with this hobby, approaching girls behind the bar and all to take great shots of them - not the excuse your wife wants to hear I think :)))-. A nice simple dSLR body and a 50 prime lens could help a lot there. Most will still fire your current flash. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I get the hint :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Azrifel: I like the reflection here.And Heineken sucks sucks sucks, that''s the message ON the bottle. :) Noise Ninja, Noise Ninja.... You so deserve a nice clean dSLR! You see, you are so serious with this hobby, approaching girls behind the bar and all to take great shots of them - not the excuse your wife wants to hear I think :)))-. A nice simple dSLR body and a 50 prime lens could help a lot there. Most will still fire your current flash.  I get the hint :-)', '2006-07-29 19:48:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2675623, 366155, 22301, '<td valign="top">Josh, Thanks for your comment on my on the beach entry, I thought I would return the favor. I think your composition and lighting on this photo are great. My main critique would be about the actual phot size itself, I wisj it was the full 640 max size, yours is 620, and your file size is 82 kb and the max is 150 kb. using the full file size would have helped smooth out the shot so the small details in the pier would be less jaggedy. Here is the <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link</a> to the preparing images for challenge tutorial using photoshop. Hor this was helpful, thanks again for a comment.</td>', 'Josh, Thanks for your comment on my on the beach entry, I thought I would return the favor. I think your composition and lighting on this photo are great. My main critique would be about the actual phot size itself, I wisj it was the full 640 max size, yours is 620, and your file size is 82 kb and the max is 150 kb. using the full file size would have helped smooth out the shot so the small details in the pier would be less jaggedy. Here is the link to the preparing images for challenge tutorial using photoshop. Hor this was helpful, thanks again for a comment.', '2006-07-30 04:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2675627, 365610, 43434, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot .. it shows lovely lines .. and the clarity of the birds etc is wonderful :)</td>', 'I really like this shot .. it shows lovely lines .. and the clarity of the birds etc is wonderful :)', '2006-07-30 04:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2676228, 365455, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading Post Comment<br/> <br/>Macabre photo executed well.  (Not your everyday item found on the beach.)  It''s the idea that makes this photo...the technical aspects are very good (especially the sea foam)...but the idea is very creative.  Congrats on your high finish.</td>', 'Trading Post Comment Macabre photo executed well.  (Not your everyday item found on the beach.)  It''s the idea that makes this photo...the technical aspects are very good (especially the sea foam)...but the idea is very creative.  Congrats on your high finish.', '2006-07-30 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2676280, 364293, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading post Comment<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful photo, capturing the moment very well.  The exposure is right on.  The composition works too...nice placement of the boy within the photo.  Colors are good...pastel water does not compete for attention with the primary subject of the photo.  The simplicity of this photo is very appealing.  All in all I would have to say this is my favorite shot of all photos you have produced.  The average commenters score of 7.571 is a fairer score than the average all users score IMHO.  Well done.</td>', 'Trading post Comment This is a beautiful photo, capturing the moment very well.  The exposure is right on.  The composition works too...nice placement of the boy within the photo.  Colors are good...pastel water does not compete for attention with the primary subject of the photo.  The simplicity of this photo is very appealing.  All in all I would have to say this is my favorite shot of all photos you have produced.  The average commenters score of 7.571 is a fairer score than the average all users score IMHO.  Well done.', '2006-07-30 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
