(2676992, 364725, 57229, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot. Don''t know what people are looking for, but for my taste, less plastic, more texture and perhaps a little less saturation/contrast...<br/> <br/>I can see that the ''total'' silhouette effect is deliberate. YOu would probably have to be <i>very</i> clever to light the skeleton for texture while not losing that effect. Just a thought.<br/> <br/>Hey, my picture''s good too, and I didn''t get anywhere near 33rd :)</td>', 'Terrific shot. Don''t know what people are looking for, but for my taste, less plastic, more texture and perhaps a little less saturation/contrast... I can see that the ''total'' silhouette effect is deliberate. YOu would probably have to be very clever to light the skeleton for texture while not losing that effect. Just a thought. Hey, my picture''s good too, and I didn''t get anywhere near 33rd :)', '2006-07-30 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
