(3373632, 365301, 7743, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is wonderful.  There are actually several images in one.  The one you chose to present, the tall grass (with or without the bird) and the yellow flowers.<br/> <br/>The diagonal of the path makes for a dynamic image though I think shooting from a slightly different location (more to the right) you would be be able to show more of it without the flowers obscuring it.</td>', 'The lighting here is wonderful.  There are actually several images in one.  The one you chose to present, the tall grass (with or without the bird) and the yellow flowers. The diagonal of the path makes for a dynamic image though I think shooting from a slightly different location (more to the right) you would be be able to show more of it without the flowers obscuring it.', '2007-02-16 19:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3401021, 366027, 46288, '<td valign="top">Hello, this is Inma (Imagine74)<br/> <br/>First Impression: nice image<br/>Composition: very well balanced (although it was the way your sister left them)<br/>Subject: good for the challenge <br/>Technical: good composition, good focus, nice use of duetone <br/>Improvement: perhaps the sandals could be better on the right up of the photo (the shoes could indicate so the way to the beach)<br/>Summary: very nice idea and shot <br/></td>', 'Hello, this is Inma (Imagine74) First Impression: nice imageComposition: very well balanced (although it was the way your sister left them)Subject: good for the challenge Technical: good composition, good focus, nice use of duetone Improvement: perhaps the sandals could be better on the right up of the photo (the shoes could indicate so the way to the beach)Summary: very nice idea and shot ', '2007-02-24 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 0),
