(4069830, 366164, 24486, '<td valign="top">I spotted the title in your portfolio &amp; thought that looks rather interesting. It really got a laugh out of me when I opened it up.</td>', 'I spotted the title in your portfolio & thought that looks rather interesting. It really got a laugh out of me when I opened it up.', '2007-09-07 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072478, 364293, 48389, '<td valign="top">A great reminder of childhood summer days! I used to love my summer holidays with my Grandparents as we always spent a week at the beach near them! This little guy certainly seems to be enjoying his summer and looks as though he knows what he''s building! Lovely summer image, thank you for sharing :o)</td>', 'A great reminder of childhood summer days! I used to love my summer holidays with my Grandparents as we always spent a week at the beach near them! This little guy certainly seems to be enjoying his summer and looks as though he knows what he''s building! Lovely summer image, thank you for sharing :o)', '2007-09-08 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4074260, 364293, 54033, '<td valign="top">This is good. It is so good I am looking at it now for stress therapy.<br/>I have so much business, thanks God, and moments with this take me away for a very relaxing feeling.<br/>Thanks for sharing.<br/>Tareq<br/> <br/>When I see good; I cant see details and lighting and stuff and focus, I just see an overall beauty.<br/> <br/>I shouldnt expect to be billed, should I?<br/></td>', 'This is good. It is so good I am looking at it now for stress therapy.I have so much business, thanks God, and moments with this take me away for a very relaxing feeling.Thanks for sharing.Tareq When I see good; I cant see details and lighting and stuff and focus, I just see an overall beauty. I shouldnt expect to be billed, should I?', '2007-09-09 04:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4085007, 364994, 70675, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture, cool colors nice detail.</td>', 'Awesome picture, cool colors nice detail.', '2007-09-12 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4209864, 365427, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a good find, and even with the horizon out of level, it makes a cool looking image. It also looks a lot like a moray eel with the split at the end of the limb, but more people recognize a barracuda, so good choice for the title.  I can see that you were using the bottom part of the stump as the base line in your composition, and why you overlooked the horizon when shooting this.</td>', 'This is a good find, and even with the horizon out of level, it makes a cool looking image. It also looks a lot like a moray eel with the split at the end of the limb, but more people recognize a barracuda, so good choice for the title.  I can see that you were using the bottom part of the stump as the base line in your composition, and why you overlooked the horizon when shooting this.', '2007-10-31 21:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
