(4329402, 365610, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but I''d like it better if I could see more detail in the birds and the far end of the pier.  The shot kind of feels caught between being about the perspective and being about the birds.</td>', 'I like the subject, but I''d like it better if I could see more detail in the birds and the far end of the pier.  The shot kind of feels caught between being about the perspective and being about the birds.', '2007-12-22 01:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4446953, 363499, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the atmosphere is wonderfully idyllic.... and that man in the shade somehow really does look like rip van winkle. ;) Also, getting the right exposure in outdoor shots like this - where there is both sun and shade - is very difficult. But you''ve exposed this perfectly. Nice work!</td>', 'I really like this, the atmosphere is wonderfully idyllic.... and that man in the shade somehow really does look like rip van winkle. ;) Also, getting the right exposure in outdoor shots like this - where there is both sun and shade - is very difficult. But you''ve exposed this perfectly. Nice work!', '2008-02-01 13:53:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4489764, 365968, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2008-02-15 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
